('a440124d-b30a-b9f2-2bfe-5436048c51ae', 'en', 'Our hands have not shed this blood'),
('a8c4a59f-6dbf-faeb-6d66-5dd6dc86391f', 'de', 'Möge der Fluch von uns weichen'),
('a8c4a59f-6dbf-faeb-6d66-5dd6dc86391f', 'en', 'May the curse depart from us'),
('bf3fd0ea-22a3-79e8-9cc3-f289f658aa2b', 'de', 'Der Ölbaum welkt, und die Ameise ermüdet'),
('bf3fd0ea-22a3-79e8-9cc3-f289f658aa2b', 'en', 'The olive tree fades and the ant grows weary'),
('5eed837e-7507-11da-af5a-d36397b39e5f', 'de', 'Der Feigenbaum verdorrt, und die Biene verstummt'),
('5eed837e-7507-11da-af5a-d36397b39e5f', 'en', 'The fig tree withers and the bee falls silent'),
('4cdcb0f6-f6e4-9cc2-9dc6-cba0f4316b85', 'de', 'Der Weinstock verkümmert, und die Grille schweigt'),
('4cdcb0f6-f6e4-9cc2-9dc6-cba0f4316b85', 'en', 'The vine shrivels and the cricket stays silent'),
('56e59c55-8ef3-be7f-92f7-deb2ab088179', 'de', 'Der Mandelbaum blüht, und die Heuschrecke schleppt sich mühsam'),
('56e59c55-8ef3-be7f-92f7-deb2ab088179', 'en', 'The almond tree blossoms and the grasshopper drags itself along'),
('d58f3f6e-67a6-5d99-a207-c53ee1f88522', 'de', 'Aus dem Holz eines Mandelbaums'),
('d58f3f6e-67a6-5d99-a207-c53ee1f88522', 'en', 'Of the wood of an almond tree'),
('037b2d4d-610d-2835-635b-d42b60952121', 'de', 'Aus Bronze, nach dem Gebot des HERRN'),
('037b2d4d-610d-2835-635b-d42b60952121', 'en', 'Of bronze, according to the LORD''s command'),
('399d7ee7-b60e-8b35-694a-827098c5c09f', 'de', 'Aus Gold, das das Volk gespendet hatte'),
('399d7ee7-b60e-8b35-694a-827098c5c09f', 'en', 'Of gold that the people had donated'),
('ab8335e4-834b-eccb-fc54-19bf07cd3c42', 'de', 'Aus Silber der aegyptischen Beute'),
('ab8335e4-834b-eccb-fc54-19bf07cd3c42', 'en', 'Of silver from the Egyptian spoil'),
('e820941f-637b-1d3b-b716-90cd642e05a1', 'de', 'Sie erhoben sich und standen auf'),
('e820941f-637b-1d3b-b716-90cd642e05a1', 'en', 'They rose and stood up'),
