('e2f67f60-4992-df72-fc1e-14c6a766fa3c', 'en', 'God saves the afflicted by their affliction and opens their ear through distress'),
('2629df26-f4f3-8280-0c7f-5346a98e7a4e', 'de', 'Gott straft den Sünder mit ewigem Feuer'),
('2629df26-f4f3-8280-0c7f-5346a98e7a4e', 'en', 'God punishes the sinner with eternal fire'),
('f8d74d33-c745-0be7-6f83-215a4de88564', 'de', 'Gott vergisst den Leidenden in seiner Not'),
('f8d74d33-c745-0be7-6f83-215a4de88564', 'en', 'God forgets the suffering one in their distress'),
('06147260-a089-2271-d5da-55c9e1b31a26', 'de', 'Weil der König ihm bereits Gold gegeben hatte'),
('06147260-a089-2271-d5da-55c9e1b31a26', 'en', 'Because the king had already given him gold'),
