('f206af6c-1901-6e20-6d39-4c492dea3353', 'en', 'Favor with his father'),
('3d47f67a-1688-fbc1-3b27-9a8f9ca5499f', 'de', 'Raum zur Buße (Sinnesänderung)'),
('3d47f67a-1688-fbc1-3b27-9a8f9ca5499f', 'en', 'Place for repentance (change of mind)'),
('1199f50a-bfc9-47ad-232a-c6b2c4b62e19', 'de', 'Er versprach ihm heimlich Hilfe'),
('1199f50a-bfc9-47ad-232a-c6b2c4b62e19', 'en', 'He secretly promised him aid'),
('cf5ec119-ef55-6b35-b9c3-0741756e9473', 'de', 'Er rief ihn zum Zweikampf heraus'),
('cf5ec119-ef55-6b35-b9c3-0741756e9473', 'en', 'He challenged him to single combat'),
('1184f255-35c8-e3d6-1142-ab6998e7b830', 'de', 'Er verfluchte seine künftigen Söhne'),
('1184f255-35c8-e3d6-1142-ab6998e7b830', 'en', 'He cursed his future sons'),
('4152a637-f5a8-58e4-3f2e-6ace2802d5e3', 'de', 'Er nannte ihn einen Blutmenschen und heißen ihn hinweggehen'),
('4152a637-f5a8-58e4-3f2e-6ace2802d5e3', 'en', 'He called him a man of blood and told him to be gone'),
('bb8da5d0-536f-5ed1-8aac-52bf8951e19c', 'de', 'Seine Amme ließ ihn auf der Flucht fallen'),
('bb8da5d0-536f-5ed1-8aac-52bf8951e19c', 'en', 'His nurse dropped him while fleeing'),
('dd698593-2154-56c5-ad62-b9cd51f6b857', 'de', 'Ein Sturz vom Dach lähmte ihn als Knabe'),
('dd698593-2154-56c5-ad62-b9cd51f6b857', 'en', 'A fall from a roof lamed him as a boy'),
('e1df30cf-ed65-846d-e083-20c50d95c9a3', 'de', 'Eine Krankheit verkrümmte ihm die Füße'),
('e1df30cf-ed65-846d-e083-20c50d95c9a3', 'en', 'A disease twisted his feet'),
('bee4d7b2-73af-5029-3936-f8333d408438', 'de', 'Er wurde in einer Schlacht am Bein verwundet'),
('bee4d7b2-73af-5029-3936-f8333d408438', 'en', 'He was wounded in the leg in a battle'),
('9db4d9d4-5b74-983b-4c17-5534ed4553c5', 'de', 'Seine Stärke liegt in der Weite seines Rachens'),
('9db4d9d4-5b74-983b-4c17-5534ed4553c5', 'en', 'His power lies in the width of his jaws'),
('21151222-2f67-9f2c-7be5-50c21986341c', 'de', 'Seine Kraft ruht in den Sehnen seiner Beine'),
('21151222-2f67-9f2c-7be5-50c21986341c', 'en', 'His strength rests in the sinews of his legs'),
('d34f7ee8-42f9-bb96-960f-b5d3b07feaa9', 'de', 'Seine Kraft ist in seinen Lenden und seine Stärke in den Muskeln seines Bauches'),
('d34f7ee8-42f9-bb96-960f-b5d3b07feaa9', 'en', 'His strength is in his loins and his power in his belly''s muscles'),
('f414c4ef-7365-5cb8-5db5-b42c8fcf0c60', 'de', 'Seine Kraft wohnt in seinen Hörnern und Klauen'),
('f414c4ef-7365-5cb8-5db5-b42c8fcf0c60', 'en', 'His strength lives in his horns and claws'),
('4873dd8f-977b-46e3-7c86-851cf655f819', 'de', 'Er war von Feuer versengt'),
('4873dd8f-977b-46e3-7c86-851cf655f819', 'en', 'It was scorched by fire'),
('d1ddef55-aab7-ee60-7694-c963fc50341a', 'de', 'Er war mit Gold durchwoben'),
('d1ddef55-aab7-ee60-7694-c963fc50341a', 'en', 'It was woven through with gold'),
('f8060125-d5fa-9894-127c-fe6760b1bc16', 'de', 'Er war zu Staub zerfallen'),
('f8060125-d5fa-9894-127c-fe6760b1bc16', 'en', 'It had crumbled into dust'),
('b6785889-8fa7-ff78-9f16-cc1a64d6ebce', 'de', 'Er war verdorben und zu nichts mehr nütze'),
('b6785889-8fa7-ff78-9f16-cc1a64d6ebce', 'en', 'It was ruined and good for nothing'),
('f924d9bd-19e5-8f6c-c556-407de40c416d', 'de', 'Elisa schrieb einen Brief an den König'),
('f924d9bd-19e5-8f6c-c556-407de40c416d', 'en', 'Elisha wrote a letter to the king'),
('180bcbb1-ec5f-cd5b-3351-04b825258eb8', 'de', 'Gerade als Gehasi ihre Geschichte dem König erzählte'),
('180bcbb1-ec5f-cd5b-3351-04b825258eb8', 'en', 'Just as Gehazi was telling the king her story'),
('46fb4e2a-8153-5b58-9a8d-e5eeddec5223', 'de', 'Der König erkannte sie am Siegelring'),
('46fb4e2a-8153-5b58-9a8d-e5eeddec5223', 'en', 'The king recognized her by a signet ring'),
('24aed411-cbf3-1ffb-c56f-88db06bf9cd2', 'de', 'Durch einen Rechtsstreit vor den Ältesten'),
('24aed411-cbf3-1ffb-c56f-88db06bf9cd2', 'en', 'Through a lawsuit before the elders'),
('7cc03657-4c6a-efbb-b52c-37159770781a', 'de', 'Sie zerbrachen und fuhren nicht aus'),
('7cc03657-4c6a-efbb-b52c-37159770781a', 'en', 'They were wrecked and never set sail'),
('72499394-fadb-760a-7298-5c7aa50729bf', 'de', 'Sie brachten reiche Beute aus Ofir'),
('72499394-fadb-760a-7298-5c7aa50729bf', 'en', 'They brought rich spoil from Ophir'),
('95c1e751-dbfe-7f6a-27fc-8124c43392dc', 'de', 'Sie sanken erst nach der ersten Fahrt'),
('95c1e751-dbfe-7f6a-27fc-8124c43392dc', 'en', 'They sank only after the first voyage'),
('f14b2c59-f010-b751-7915-2857178cb8fa', 'de', 'Sie wurden von Piraten gekapert'),
('f14b2c59-f010-b751-7915-2857178cb8fa', 'en', 'They were seized by pirates'),
('1063ec0e-0a8f-fa3c-706a-b9da13920168', 'de', 'Am Fluss vor dem Tor, wo man das Gebet zu verrichten pflegte'),
('1063ec0e-0a8f-fa3c-706a-b9da13920168', 'en', 'By the river outside the gate, where prayer was customarily made'),
('4bc605a4-9254-a43d-7b40-d4509ec8e043', 'de', 'Am Hafen unter den fremden Kaufleuten'),
('4bc605a4-9254-a43d-7b40-d4509ec8e043', 'en', 'At the harbor among the foreign merchants'),
('1a82eb8c-5d8f-9895-3977-c97b655e6dd0', 'de', 'In der Synagoge mitten in der Stadt'),
('1a82eb8c-5d8f-9895-3977-c97b655e6dd0', 'en', 'In the synagogue in the middle of the city'),
('06af0892-d5f3-001d-0295-1b1f5be5fecb', 'de', 'Im Haus des römischen Statthalters'),
('06af0892-d5f3-001d-0295-1b1f5be5fecb', 'en', 'In the house of the Roman governor'),
('5f1fbcf3-e55d-73fd-f694-225c9ce6d133', 'de', 'Sie brachten sie nach Betlehem'),
('5f1fbcf3-e55d-73fd-f694-225c9ce6d133', 'en', 'They brought them to Bethlehem'),
('0b114c7f-f590-1d95-7e73-1a6ea12b8fa8', 'de', 'Sie holten sie von der Mauer und verbrannten sie in Jabesch'),
('0b114c7f-f590-1d95-7e73-1a6ea12b8fa8', 'en', 'They took them from the wall and burned them at Jabesh'),
('89f74d57-ed30-90fa-bc0f-364e0917758a', 'de', 'Sie übergaben sie den Philistern'),
('89f74d57-ed30-90fa-bc0f-364e0917758a', 'en', 'They handed them to the Philistines'),
('329c1706-8b4e-78ec-614f-e4fed3d8cc5e', 'de', 'Sie begruben sie in Gilboa'),
('329c1706-8b4e-78ec-614f-e4fed3d8cc5e', 'en', 'They buried them at Gilboa'),
('6ec51679-dd39-7d44-3564-9c7e18952dca', 'de', 'Zwölf Köpfe und zehn Hörner'),
('6ec51679-dd39-7d44-3564-9c7e18952dca', 'en', 'Twelve heads and ten horns'),
('102541b6-703c-0e96-eddb-5157c7c07e1e', 'de', 'Sieben Köpfe und sieben Hörner'),
('102541b6-703c-0e96-eddb-5157c7c07e1e', 'en', 'Seven heads and seven horns'),
('f2430b40-615d-358f-b1ce-18f3dd86aad4', 'de', 'Sieben Köpfe und zehn Hörner'),
('f2430b40-615d-358f-b1ce-18f3dd86aad4', 'en', 'Seven heads and ten horns'),
('308f72a4-a760-225e-3034-59696c822a72', 'de', 'Zehn Köpfe und sieben Hörner'),
('308f72a4-a760-225e-3034-59696c822a72', 'en', 'Ten heads and seven horns'),
('c971d202-ab0d-25e1-c199-913cb5eae495', 'de', 'Sieben Tage spaeter als die anderen'),
('c971d202-ab0d-25e1-c199-913cb5eae495', 'en', 'Seven days later than the others'),
('308b7846-4593-fda7-60e4-834db44a1c3a', 'de', 'Im zweiten Monat, am vierzehnten Tag'),
('308b7846-4593-fda7-60e4-834db44a1c3a', 'en', 'In the second month, on the fourteenth day'),
('c07849b5-aeb3-4786-fd4e-b1835473309b', 'de', 'Gar nicht in jenem Jahr'),
('c07849b5-aeb3-4786-fd4e-b1835473309b', 'en', 'Not at all in that year'),
('9491e2b2-ca9e-3f73-a186-677cf5a75540', 'de', 'Am ersten Tag des dritten Monats'),
('9491e2b2-ca9e-3f73-a186-677cf5a75540', 'en', 'On the first day of the third month'),
('84603631-9cea-86a6-7602-f3f51f4ae7a4', 'de', 'Als die Engel schwiegen und die Erde zitterte'),
('84603631-9cea-86a6-7602-f3f51f4ae7a4', 'en', 'When the angels fell silent and the earth trembled'),
('572fd3ea-07f1-fd98-dee5-781ba0755c04', 'de', 'Als die Meere klatschten und die Flüsse hüpften'),
('572fd3ea-07f1-fd98-dee5-781ba0755c04', 'en', 'When the seas clapped and the rivers leaped'),
('fa651d4c-9bfb-3b87-0d1f-e816fd561cbf', 'de', 'Als die Morgensterne miteinander jubelten und alle Gottessöhne jauchzten'),
('fa651d4c-9bfb-3b87-0d1f-e816fd561cbf', 'en', 'When the morning stars sang together and all the sons of God shouted for joy'),
('06c4ef29-cd2e-ece5-b43f-0b44f48d1d45', 'de', 'Als die Berge Loblieder sangen und die Täler antworteten'),
('06c4ef29-cd2e-ece5-b43f-0b44f48d1d45', 'en', 'When the mountains sang praise and the valleys answered')
insert into public.answer_option_translations (option_id, lang, text) values
('4c9534c6-9ba5-86fc-397c-81ef132f4dd5', 'de', 'Ein Gericht der Brüder'),
('4c9534c6-9ba5-86fc-397c-81ef132f4dd5', 'en', 'A court of the brothers'),
('83d7e841-e658-a5a9-45bc-089bb20f4499', 'de', 'Die Gemeinde in ihrem Haus'),
('83d7e841-e658-a5a9-45bc-089bb20f4499', 'en', 'The church that met in their house'),
('b7af7a7e-abe9-61f5-397f-88f0aed32d82', 'de', 'Ein Rat der Ältesten'),
('b7af7a7e-abe9-61f5-397f-88f0aed32d82', 'en', 'A council of elders'),
('045cf672-6b7c-b881-4c42-04f072f219dd', 'de', 'Eine Schule für Propheten'),
('045cf672-6b7c-b881-4c42-04f072f219dd', 'en', 'A school for prophets'),
('96d98f8d-5a2b-5143-b017-e356cc808916', 'de', 'Ich bin zerrieben wie Staub im Wind'),
('96d98f8d-5a2b-5143-b017-e356cc808916', 'en', 'I am ground down like dust in the wind'),
('813ce238-d319-2d5a-17c0-2c596181b500', 'de', 'Ich bin zerschmolzen wie Schnee am Mittag'),
('813ce238-d319-2d5a-17c0-2c596181b500', 'en', 'I am melted like snow at noon'),
('8c6c72bf-ce76-3d25-7cb6-22ebf8b45c7f', 'de', 'Ich bin verwelkt wie das Gras des Feldes'),
('8c6c72bf-ce76-3d25-7cb6-22ebf8b45c7f', 'en', 'I am withered like the grass of the field'),
('c8fd0af8-5e0e-6fa9-ad28-628c5df424a7', 'de', 'Ich bin ausgeschüttet wie Wasser'),
('c8fd0af8-5e0e-6fa9-ad28-628c5df424a7', 'en', 'I am poured out like water'),
('e807e75c-2419-488c-b0f4-c5bc175839f6', 'de', 'Er trat hinter den Vorhang zurueck'),
('e807e75c-2419-488c-b0f4-c5bc175839f6', 'en', 'He withdrew behind the veil'),
('ce1fd26c-096c-584a-aa97-ea414eadc0f8', 'de', 'Er redete nur durch Aaron zu ihnen'),
('ce1fd26c-096c-584a-aa97-ea414eadc0f8', 'en', 'He spoke to them only through Aaron'),
('bf2e13ca-6bdc-e4a2-49aa-854b64b0604d', 'de', 'Er verhuellte sich mit einem Mantel ganz'),
('bf2e13ca-6bdc-e4a2-49aa-854b64b0604d', 'en', 'He wrapped himself wholly in a cloak'),
('d6247900-7822-0b93-80ff-1afd6b9eae02', 'de', 'Er legte eine Decke ueber sein Angesicht'),
('d6247900-7822-0b93-80ff-1afd6b9eae02', 'en', 'He put a veil over his face'),
('2e70b5ba-b03d-8cf6-d209-66deb1fa8b4b', 'de', 'Dreißig Tage lang solle man nur zum König beten'),
('2e70b5ba-b03d-8cf6-d209-66deb1fa8b4b', 'en', 'For thirty days one should pray only to the king'),
('39762bc6-67ec-852a-4c8b-6303f3bd557e', 'de', 'Niemand dürfe das Gesetz Moses lesen'),
('39762bc6-67ec-852a-4c8b-6303f3bd557e', 'en', 'No one should read the law of Moses'),
('c8f4f684-dcc0-d5b4-b902-9e6655adb884', 'de', 'Alle sollten dem goldenen Bild dienen'),
('c8f4f684-dcc0-d5b4-b902-9e6655adb884', 'en', 'All should serve the golden image'),
('dca0ef2e-3023-1c58-9719-fb7497eac8a5', 'de', 'Man solle keinen fremden Göttern opfern'),
('dca0ef2e-3023-1c58-9719-fb7497eac8a5', 'en', 'One should not sacrifice to foreign gods'),
('dfc07386-c805-e9e2-d9ca-a5ff600b5d9c', 'de', 'Um Begnadigung und Freilassung Abjatars'),
('dfc07386-c805-e9e2-d9ca-a5ff600b5d9c', 'en', 'For pardon and the release of Abiathar'),
('42d8e8f4-9af0-cbc6-4539-7e5d75128105', 'de', 'Um die Hälfte des Königreichs'),
('42d8e8f4-9af0-cbc6-4539-7e5d75128105', 'en', 'For half of the kingdom'),
('0c7cfaa9-80eb-3919-cfcd-e4278f0accf6', 'de', 'Um Abischag, die Schunemiterin, zur Frau'),
('0c7cfaa9-80eb-3919-cfcd-e4278f0accf6', 'en', 'For Abishag the Shunammite as a wife'),
('cb85ba7e-2aa6-090c-9cd6-bf12d602e38f', 'de', 'Um die Statthalterschaft über Juda'),
('cb85ba7e-2aa6-090c-9cd6-bf12d602e38f', 'en', 'For the governorship over Judah'),
('cf3630b8-824c-0e3a-691b-de726793105f', 'de', 'Sie nahmen Bestechung und beugten das Recht'),
('cf3630b8-824c-0e3a-691b-de726793105f', 'en', 'They took bribes and perverted justice'),
('fcb881dc-ec16-2997-bdbc-ae37d2daedba', 'de', 'Sie plünderten das Heiligtum'),
('fcb881dc-ec16-2997-bdbc-ae37d2daedba', 'en', 'They plundered the sanctuary'),
('3c46d58e-a0e5-b767-be99-a43005d4acfd', 'de', 'Sie flohen vor den Philistern'),
('3c46d58e-a0e5-b767-be99-a43005d4acfd', 'en', 'They fled from the Philistines'),
('49f163ab-a036-8576-400e-a3fb0f5318df', 'de', 'Sie opferten fremden Göttern'),
('49f163ab-a036-8576-400e-a3fb0f5318df', 'en', 'They sacrificed to foreign gods'),
('aaee10ae-4136-81a1-e134-16f6bcd7332c', 'de', 'Dass die Gemeinde reich gesegnet werde'),
('aaee10ae-4136-81a1-e134-16f6bcd7332c', 'en', 'That the church be richly blessed'),
('284e8257-a470-5692-3c8e-060919f3d3d2', 'de', 'Dass er aus der Gefangenschaft entlassen werde'),
('284e8257-a470-5692-3c8e-060919f3d3d2', 'en', 'That he be released from imprisonment'),
('0b72fba0-f5a5-f1d4-6baa-51ad5350bef5', 'de', 'Dass seine Feinde beschämt würden'),
('0b72fba0-f5a5-f1d4-6baa-51ad5350bef5', 'en', 'That his enemies be put to shame'),
('3a05ecde-f7bb-95d9-bc29-e7f457385756', 'de', 'Dass ihm das Wort gegeben werde, das Geheimnis des Evangeliums freimütig zu verkünden'),
('3a05ecde-f7bb-95d9-bc29-e7f457385756', 'en', 'That utterance be given him to make known the mystery of the gospel boldly'),
('ab7863da-c098-8019-a1f6-e0ff663847fd', 'de', 'Er verkaufte Josef an die Händler'),
('ab7863da-c098-8019-a1f6-e0ff663847fd', 'en', 'He sold Joseph to the traders'),
('a4ff1fe3-d4a9-9660-9d92-49136c679984', 'de', 'Er tötete die Männer von Sichem'),
('a4ff1fe3-d4a9-9660-9d92-49136c679984', 'en', 'He killed the men of Shechem'),
('006c87e6-8d3f-ad35-8659-a98db338756a', 'de', 'Er lag bei Bilha, der Nebenfrau seines Vaters'),
('006c87e6-8d3f-ad35-8659-a98db338756a', 'en', 'He lay with Bilhah, his father''s concubine'),
('450e35a3-9470-0faf-4d93-62efd9a37a10', 'de', 'Er raubte die Hausgötzen Labans'),
('450e35a3-9470-0faf-4d93-62efd9a37a10', 'en', 'He stole Laban''s household gods'),
('fabc5660-802e-62df-e475-f80a7d7f5c30', 'de', 'Aner seinen Verbündeten'),
('fabc5660-802e-62df-e475-f80a7d7f5c30', 'en', 'Aner his ally'),
('c2818b07-d804-426b-3665-97c21b5bacab', 'de', 'Pichol den Feldhauptmann'),
('c2818b07-d804-426b-3665-97c21b5bacab', 'en', 'Phicol the army commander'),
('d43dc287-d6c8-d0e9-00bd-9b0cfa99557a', 'de', 'Eliëser von Damaskus'),
('d43dc287-d6c8-d0e9-00bd-9b0cfa99557a', 'en', 'Eliezer of Damascus'),
('86c3a4e8-87e3-3335-9507-d7909884cdb8', 'de', 'Mamre den Amoriter'),
('86c3a4e8-87e3-3335-9507-d7909884cdb8', 'en', 'Mamre the Amorite'),
('3be9fb1c-23a8-a346-9512-2d99e2fe1e9a', 'de', 'Ihre Namen sollen aus Israel getilgt werden'),
('3be9fb1c-23a8-a346-9512-2d99e2fe1e9a', 'en', 'Their names shall be erased from Israel'),
('b9bc4c89-b920-cc92-5849-0767ebea726c', 'de', 'Ihr Erbe soll an Fremde fallen'),
('b9bc4c89-b920-cc92-5849-0767ebea726c', 'en', 'Their inheritance shall fall to strangers'),
('7167dc1d-9042-6395-0fb8-fdf6dfcd3843', 'de', 'Ihr Haus soll in Silo brennen'),
('7167dc1d-9042-6395-0fb8-fdf6dfcd3843', 'en', 'Their house at Shiloh shall burn'),
('d20cb501-8180-0e25-435d-af7e59530ca2', 'de', 'Beide sollen an einem Tag sterben'),
('d20cb501-8180-0e25-435d-af7e59530ca2', 'en', 'Both shall die on one day'),
('d841c90f-c27b-f05c-15a2-ae1abe35a884', 'de', 'Durch die Kriegslist des Josua'),
('d841c90f-c27b-f05c-15a2-ae1abe35a884', 'en', 'By the strategy of Joshua'),
('c0cfffcf-a189-163a-1e22-ea3d877e6bcf', 'de', 'Durch das Feuer vom Himmel'),
('c0cfffcf-a189-163a-1e22-ea3d877e6bcf', 'en', 'By fire from heaven'),
('aee563d5-82ec-df0a-57f9-83d5210f147b', 'de', 'Durch Glauben, nachdem sie sieben Tage umzogen worden waren'),
('aee563d5-82ec-df0a-57f9-83d5210f147b', 'en', 'By faith, after being encircled for seven days'),
('cfd7d274-316d-4bd2-afbb-ab1822cad7b9', 'de', 'Durch ein gewaltiges Erdbeben'),
('cfd7d274-316d-4bd2-afbb-ab1822cad7b9', 'en', 'By a mighty earthquake'),
('104e4ef8-2888-d109-f7bc-ef0c26a439e2', 'de', 'Mit einer Versammlung der Ältesten'),
('104e4ef8-2888-d109-f7bc-ef0c26a439e2', 'en', 'To an assembly of elders'),
('93bf5b1b-3469-9c06-f9a1-c5f5403fbe9a', 'de', 'Mit einem Heer der Streiter'),
('93bf5b1b-3469-9c06-f9a1-c5f5403fbe9a', 'en', 'To an army of warriors'),
('fe930043-94e8-2504-55f3-ae67cdb4b803', 'de', 'Mit einer Schar von Engeln'),
('fe930043-94e8-2504-55f3-ae67cdb4b803', 'en', 'To a host of angels'),
('52406971-3913-893b-4fe4-2d1be660c055', 'de', 'Mit einer so großen Wolke von Zeugen'),
('52406971-3913-893b-4fe4-2d1be660c055', 'en', 'To so great a cloud of witnesses'),
('1aa6c690-70af-b293-d8c7-550d604f6c5e', 'de', 'Wenn ein Fuchs hinaufliefe, risse er ihre Steinmauer ein'),
