('9172fb0a-e03e-b66e-0825-e7626206471b', 'en', 'He sent them to Pharaoh in Egypt'),
('bb8a7dde-70f0-4c58-0dff-59ea44aa6745', 'de', 'Man wartete auf die Rueckkehr des Hohepriesters'),
('bb8a7dde-70f0-4c58-0dff-59ea44aa6745', 'en', 'They awaited the high priest''s return'),
