('d39f1b23-dd4d-7c91-a614-0a340f73e1f5', 'en', 'As an insult to Bathsheba, which he forgave'),
('8af65b47-c4b2-bfe2-b262-8942479cd68b', 'de', 'Als List Joabs, den er dafür bestrafte'),
('8af65b47-c4b2-bfe2-b262-8942479cd68b', 'en', 'As a scheme of Joab, whom he punished for it'),
('10acf14c-5cc2-7a9c-8289-813c417e3937', 'de', 'Als Anspruch auf das Königtum, weshalb er Adonijas Tod befahl'),
('10acf14c-5cc2-7a9c-8289-813c417e3937', 'en', 'As a claim to the kingship, so he ordered Adonijah''s death'),
('4a2d3404-467e-1727-77fb-e4658a3f7bed', 'de', 'Seine Hand verdorrte zur Strafe'),
('4a2d3404-467e-1727-77fb-e4658a3f7bed', 'en', 'His hand withered as a punishment'),
