('0ad7c187-3421-6c61-2d3b-78730f0db2e3', 'en', 'From the top of Mount Gerizim'),
('e8d2c514-2d51-c0f7-320b-f68b4f9eebcc', 'de', 'Vom Gipfel des Berges Ebal'),
('e8d2c514-2d51-c0f7-320b-f68b4f9eebcc', 'en', 'From the top of Mount Ebal'),
('30ebe4ae-e191-9912-d3a2-63686a051f0c', 'de', 'Vom Gipfel des Berges Gilboa'),
('30ebe4ae-e191-9912-d3a2-63686a051f0c', 'en', 'From the top of Mount Gilboa'),
('293f481f-b36d-93f4-dece-910db409b322', 'de', 'Vom Gipfel des Berges Tabor'),
('293f481f-b36d-93f4-dece-910db409b322', 'en', 'From the top of Mount Tabor'),
('efbb12ce-91c7-25bd-1cb1-9dace9679d04', 'de', 'Nach den Chroniken Nebukadnezars'),
('efbb12ce-91c7-25bd-1cb1-9dace9679d04', 'en', 'For the chronicles of Nebuchadnezzar'),
('c7eb222b-0e05-b4bf-d09d-6adeaf874278', 'de', 'Nach dem Gesetzbuch Moses'),
('c7eb222b-0e05-b4bf-d09d-6adeaf874278', 'en', 'For the book of the law of Moses'),
('88ea23bd-7839-5476-34a7-a390714c4e44', 'de', 'Nach den Verträgen mit den Samaritern'),
('88ea23bd-7839-5476-34a7-a390714c4e44', 'en', 'For the treaties with the Samaritans'),
('49069a78-76ee-fed4-486e-17b81186e196', 'de', 'Nach der Urkunde des Kyrus im Schatzhaus zu Ekbatana'),
('49069a78-76ee-fed4-486e-17b81186e196', 'en', 'For the decree of Cyrus in the treasury at Ecbatana'),
('0ad92cac-abac-82ee-f2fe-decb51214151', 'de', 'Der Löwe, der Held unter den Tieren'),
('0ad92cac-abac-82ee-f2fe-decb51214151', 'en', 'The lion, mighty among beasts'),
('48595e86-e39e-1ce5-a5b0-3dc7e7e32c28', 'de', 'Der Stier, der Herr der Herde'),
('48595e86-e39e-1ce5-a5b0-3dc7e7e32c28', 'en', 'The bull, lord of the herd'),
('6d99b8b5-0047-7d8f-bd07-dae6b72cdbf5', 'de', 'Der Hirsch, der König des Waldes'),
('6d99b8b5-0047-7d8f-bd07-dae6b72cdbf5', 'en', 'The stag, king of the forest'),
('fb28c9d0-7d03-3751-bfa0-3a1ec360f8e3', 'de', 'Der Elefant, der Riese der Steppe'),
('fb28c9d0-7d03-3751-bfa0-3a1ec360f8e3', 'en', 'The elephant, giant of the plains'),
('d806e02e-05fb-d411-ab88-69d812c19078', 'de', 'Kein Erbarmen'),
('d806e02e-05fb-d411-ab88-69d812c19078', 'en', 'No mercy'),
('94340ff6-3157-ab77-6792-b5df74494564', 'de', 'Gott zerstreut'),
('94340ff6-3157-ab77-6792-b5df74494564', 'en', 'God scatters'),
('8c59cfde-7ff1-3963-1a11-53519661569e', 'de', 'Sohn des Zorns'),
('8c59cfde-7ff1-3963-1a11-53519661569e', 'en', 'Son of wrath'),
('66068cdc-15ec-3d62-82ae-d4fc540410f7', 'de', 'Nicht mein Volk'),
('66068cdc-15ec-3d62-82ae-d4fc540410f7', 'en', 'Not my people'),
('113ef87c-ce8c-8568-5d57-42dc267b59d3', 'de', 'Er ließ den Boten töten, weil er Hand an den Gesalbten gelegt hatte'),
('113ef87c-ce8c-8568-5d57-42dc267b59d3', 'en', 'He had the messenger killed for laying hands on the anointed'),
('b414695d-bbe4-bfee-5497-827589c04286', 'de', 'Er nahm sie und setzte die Krone selbst auf'),
('b414695d-bbe4-bfee-5497-827589c04286', 'en', 'He took them and set the crown on himself'),
('79ea9e41-269a-eba8-bed1-9ff1bd26c616', 'de', 'Er sandte sie den Philistern zurück'),
('79ea9e41-269a-eba8-bed1-9ff1bd26c616', 'en', 'He sent them back to the Philistines'),
('40184c63-b610-bc8b-6939-0b5595ef2e9a', 'de', 'Er legte sie in die Lade des HERRN'),
('40184c63-b610-bc8b-6939-0b5595ef2e9a', 'en', 'He placed them in the ark of the LORD'),
('da1e2834-a002-f45c-aee2-d6a86fbc9f51', 'de', 'Er verbarg sie in der Lade'),
('da1e2834-a002-f45c-aee2-d6a86fbc9f51', 'en', 'He hid them in the ark'),
('b9dfbd16-87f6-d10d-bce3-dd5b69f82538', 'de', 'Er warf sie hin und zerbrach sie am Fuss des Berges'),
('b9dfbd16-87f6-d10d-bce3-dd5b69f82538', 'en', 'He threw them down and broke them at the foot of the mountain'),
('7700527b-4f85-2a97-8a2a-673004097b56', 'de', 'Er warf sie ins Feuer des Kalbes'),
('7700527b-4f85-2a97-8a2a-673004097b56', 'en', 'He cast them into the fire of the calf'),
('2b63db12-4eb2-0819-73aa-e6dbea8fe89f', 'de', 'Er las sie dem Volk vor und verbrannte sie'),
('2b63db12-4eb2-0819-73aa-e6dbea8fe89f', 'en', 'He read them to the people and burned them'),
('d868095a-0e85-2cfa-9a9c-0eb8adb5cd4b', 'de', 'Zwei Scherflein, das ist ein Stater'),
('d868095a-0e85-2cfa-9a9c-0eb8adb5cd4b', 'en', 'Two lepta, which make a stater'),
('3c4d4dab-4184-b86f-8232-d0740a8adede', 'de', 'Zwei Scherflein, das ist ein Assarion'),
('3c4d4dab-4184-b86f-8232-d0740a8adede', 'en', 'Two lepta, which make an assarion'),
('560c245b-13a4-dc67-bb51-61c87c054fbd', 'de', 'Zwei Scherflein, das ist ein Quadrans'),
('560c245b-13a4-dc67-bb51-61c87c054fbd', 'en', 'Two lepta, which make a quadrans'),
('d189d167-a16c-79ed-7d57-a279c9a09a75', 'de', 'Zwei Scherflein, das ist ein Denar'),
('d189d167-a16c-79ed-7d57-a279c9a09a75', 'en', 'Two lepta, which make a denarius'),
('383ccd29-7264-a600-61c1-52d57468818b', 'de', 'Mit einem Fels, der nicht wankt'),
('383ccd29-7264-a600-61c1-52d57468818b', 'en', 'With a rock that does not move'),
('11198b39-c88e-ee21-4476-a0aeec23c639', 'de', 'Mit einem Feuer, das nicht erlischt'),
('11198b39-c88e-ee21-4476-a0aeec23c639', 'en', 'With a fire that never goes out'),
('13643ac4-b712-b1d0-1c41-2bd183772e8f', 'de', 'Mit einem Licht, das die Nacht erhellt'),
('13643ac4-b712-b1d0-1c41-2bd183772e8f', 'en', 'With a light that lights the night'),
('4a724386-4902-583a-5b66-02de488f8e87', 'de', 'Mit unvergänglichem Samen, dem Wort Gottes, das ewig bleibt'),
('4a724386-4902-583a-5b66-02de488f8e87', 'en', 'With imperishable seed, the word of God that abides forever'),
('1f6bc670-fb44-0950-0ae1-27d1d52e69c0', 'de', 'Man solle sie zum Priester bringen'),
('1f6bc670-fb44-0950-0ae1-27d1d52e69c0', 'en', 'That she be brought to the priest'),
('605f4068-db9e-2025-9eb0-7c0f2c945af8', 'de', 'Man solle ihr zu essen geben'),
('605f4068-db9e-2025-9eb0-7c0f2c945af8', 'en', 'That she should be given something to eat'),
('ae87ceb1-f7de-b36a-6ce8-d36e610b7c86', 'de', 'Man solle ein Opfer darbringen'),
('ae87ceb1-f7de-b36a-6ce8-d36e610b7c86', 'en', 'That a sacrifice be offered'),
('09b64d2c-1a3f-bdb5-2ed1-a7cab4da96a8', 'de', 'Man solle es allen verkünden'),
('09b64d2c-1a3f-bdb5-2ed1-a7cab4da96a8', 'en', 'That it be proclaimed to all'),
('a6e65f7b-7f24-f960-27e6-f9efed419e99', 'de', 'Bei der Höhle Machpela in Hebron'),
('a6e65f7b-7f24-f960-27e6-f9efed419e99', 'en', 'At the cave of Machpelah in Hebron'),
('9deffecc-6be2-1390-52b4-ec32dfcfc17e', 'de', 'In der Stadt Sichem'),
('9deffecc-6be2-1390-52b4-ec32dfcfc17e', 'en', 'In the city of Shechem'),
('ec99fad9-3023-eaee-915c-16be986d508b', 'de', 'Am Brunnen von Beerscheba'),
('ec99fad9-3023-eaee-915c-16be986d508b', 'en', 'At the well of Beersheba'),
('8bf851b1-24cf-763e-693d-e698524fddc2', 'de', 'Auf dem Weg nach Ephrata, das ist Bethlehem'),
('8bf851b1-24cf-763e-693d-e698524fddc2', 'en', 'On the way to Ephrath, that is Bethlehem'),
('42d8f472-6794-a7fb-12c3-955bb906da07', 'de', 'Weizen, Gerste, Bohnen, Linsen, Hirse und Spelt'),
('42d8f472-6794-a7fb-12c3-955bb906da07', 'en', 'Wheat, barley, beans, lentils, millet and spelt'),
('552edc00-07a2-1726-2e5e-9c5b138ec9e8', 'de', 'Gerste und Öl'),
('552edc00-07a2-1726-2e5e-9c5b138ec9e8', 'en', 'Barley and oil'),
('def1f3d8-ebe4-7008-60df-819ae4ba54ed', 'de', 'Feigen und Datteln'),
('def1f3d8-ebe4-7008-60df-819ae4ba54ed', 'en', 'Figs and dates'),
('0f156d6b-6d62-c181-372a-2a3be3999b60', 'de', 'Nur Weizen und Wasser'),
('0f156d6b-6d62-c181-372a-2a3be3999b60', 'en', 'Only wheat and water'),
('c8f99424-a7f0-01f0-62e4-f36f9aeb44a3', 'de', 'Seinen ältesten Bruder'),
('c8f99424-a7f0-01f0-62e4-f36f9aeb44a3', 'en', 'His eldest brother'),
('983036b3-4ed5-c5f6-f80c-2ddfd1584198', 'de', 'Einen seiner eigenen Söhne'),
('983036b3-4ed5-c5f6-f80c-2ddfd1584198', 'en', 'One of his own sons'),
('82e10f71-a1ea-2b3b-fc97-6d8a653b4ffe', 'de', 'Einen Wanderpriester aus Bethlehem'),
('82e10f71-a1ea-2b3b-fc97-6d8a653b4ffe', 'en', 'A wandering priest from Bethlehem'),
('2c4a1834-3422-2774-c68f-0989dc5c7e04', 'de', 'Einen gekauften Sklaven'),
('2c4a1834-3422-2774-c68f-0989dc5c7e04', 'en', 'A purchased slave'),
('55448ba2-e190-bff7-576e-cdbdb2fc4a56', 'de', 'Serája, der Hohepriester'),
('55448ba2-e190-bff7-576e-cdbdb2fc4a56', 'en', 'Seraiah the high priest'),
('708d7f79-db13-eb5a-086b-65d0145d1672', 'de', 'Eljaschib, der Torhüter'),
('708d7f79-db13-eb5a-086b-65d0145d1672', 'en', 'Eliashib the gatekeeper'),
('87a6c23d-594a-a970-c290-0e44568a11d0', 'de', 'Jeschua, der Sohn Jozadaks'),
('87a6c23d-594a-a970-c290-0e44568a11d0', 'en', 'Jeshua, the son of Jozadak'),
('f7cd16c1-0976-cfd5-8e4a-0c166a5fcf79', 'de', 'Hilkija, der Sohn Schallums'),
('f7cd16c1-0976-cfd5-8e4a-0c166a5fcf79', 'en', 'Hilkiah, the son of Shallum'),
('e43f7d05-912c-5a4c-982d-ad39c3a3ea09', 'de', 'Einen kleinen Zweig aus Zedernholz'),
('e43f7d05-912c-5a4c-982d-ad39c3a3ea09', 'en', 'A small twig of cedar'),
('33395099-16c8-d2df-b123-36c2c96deee1', 'de', 'Eine Handvoll Erde'),
('33395099-16c8-d2df-b123-36c2c96deee1', 'en', 'A handful of soil'),
('f9a8f742-09ce-fb59-5299-c13386c1114e', 'de', 'Ein frisches Ölblatt im Schnabel'),
('f9a8f742-09ce-fb59-5299-c13386c1114e', 'en', 'A fresh olive leaf in its beak'),
('bf054bd8-4ff0-34a1-84e8-8184f41e150b', 'de', 'Ein Weizenkorn'),
('bf054bd8-4ff0-34a1-84e8-8184f41e150b', 'en', 'A grain of wheat'),
('ff2c6d5b-8aa5-7fd1-d4a2-f39e9cd60713', 'de', 'Er sandte ihn belastet mit den Suenden in die Wueste'),
('ff2c6d5b-8aa5-7fd1-d4a2-f39e9cd60713', 'en', 'He sent it laden with the sins into the wilderness'),
('64e9349e-8e67-7a3b-65f1-0e54c995e0bf', 'de', 'Er liess ihn dem Volk zum Mahl'),
('64e9349e-8e67-7a3b-65f1-0e54c995e0bf', 'en', 'He gave it to the people for a meal'),
('2aa968cb-6020-7899-e047-ad0813a4edb4', 'de', 'Er verbrannte ihn ausserhalb des Lagers'),
('2aa968cb-6020-7899-e047-ad0813a4edb4', 'en', 'He burned it outside the camp'),
('ecee9c29-3af5-307e-10fc-52ad94177a24', 'de', 'Er schlachtete ihn auf dem bronzenen Altar'),
('ecee9c29-3af5-307e-10fc-52ad94177a24', 'en', 'He slaughtered it on the bronze altar'),
('c2983b0d-e68d-4a32-ff89-a490eecd8238', 'de', 'Nur in Traeumen der Nacht'),
('c2983b0d-e68d-4a32-ff89-a490eecd8238', 'en', 'Only in dreams of the night'),
('caec4c4b-af84-be49-ab17-6b7e1d8386ed', 'de', 'Von Mund zu Mund, nicht in Raetseln'),
('caec4c4b-af84-be49-ab17-6b7e1d8386ed', 'en', 'Mouth to mouth, not in riddles'),
('a4355ce6-14d3-2719-fe8e-8b55449f77cb', 'de', 'Allein durch die Wolkensaeule'),
('a4355ce6-14d3-2719-fe8e-8b55449f77cb', 'en', 'Only through the pillar of cloud'),
('56abd2a2-5e29-0d74-ea09-230029730ae0', 'de', 'Durch das Los am Ephod'),
('56abd2a2-5e29-0d74-ea09-230029730ae0', 'en', 'Through the lot on the ephod'),
('fa9f2bfb-4a65-8b40-f360-6c5813f185d4', 'de', 'Er verkaufte sie an Tyrus'),
('fa9f2bfb-4a65-8b40-f360-6c5813f185d4', 'en', 'He sold them to Tyre'),
('ad8d676c-f573-d49e-97e5-3e87ef2223f4', 'de', 'Er schloss die Türen und zerschlug die Geräte'),
('ad8d676c-f573-d49e-97e5-3e87ef2223f4', 'en', 'He shut the doors and cut the vessels in pieces'),
('c2c58425-51af-b7bf-b15a-977f740c91f2', 'de', 'Er brachte sie nach Damaskus in Sicherheit'),
('c2c58425-51af-b7bf-b15a-977f740c91f2', 'en', 'He brought them to safety in Damascus'),
('e286f672-db77-794e-ccb3-5e9548184814', 'de', 'Er ließ sie mit Gold überziehen'),
('e286f672-db77-794e-ccb3-5e9548184814', 'en', 'He had them overlaid with gold'),
('c14845ee-75d1-9716-51ba-a7b65eee1788', 'de', 'Er wurde entrückt, weil er Gott gefiel'),
('c14845ee-75d1-9716-51ba-a7b65eee1788', 'en', 'He was translated because he pleased God'),
('6b64654f-c877-c2ca-d6e8-f79b8f62abf3', 'de', 'Er verbarg sich in einer Höhle'),
('6b64654f-c877-c2ca-d6e8-f79b8f62abf3', 'en', 'He hid himself in a cave'),
('9e804ea0-6f97-9a7f-9b7d-fe356811774c', 'de', 'Er wurde zum Priester gesalbt'),
('9e804ea0-6f97-9a7f-9b7d-fe356811774c', 'en', 'He was anointed as a priest'),
('45b2c58e-9e06-f4f9-ffdd-97627d855b0f', 'de', 'Er wurde im Feuerwagen aufgenommen'),
('45b2c58e-9e06-f4f9-ffdd-97627d855b0f', 'en', 'He was taken up in a chariot of fire'),
('25e36c1b-559d-6d2c-5bbe-467807bc1721', 'de', 'Pergamon'),
('25e36c1b-559d-6d2c-5bbe-467807bc1721', 'en', 'Pergamum'),
('67d544a3-2c20-419f-c9fc-f5c97905caa1', 'de', 'Smyrna'),
('67d544a3-2c20-419f-c9fc-f5c97905caa1', 'en', 'Smyrna'),
('ba25010b-775b-f1b5-7815-3e9a9ead86cc', 'de', 'Philadelphia'),
('ba25010b-775b-f1b5-7815-3e9a9ead86cc', 'en', 'Philadelphia'),
('2ebc5c3c-2a2d-fe99-3dda-7907411ecb2e', 'de', 'Thyatira'),
('2ebc5c3c-2a2d-fe99-3dda-7907411ecb2e', 'en', 'Thyatira'),
('6fc05bed-a86d-684a-eced-5d6abad6bb5f', 'de', 'Saul hat Tausend erschlagen, David aber Zehntausend'),
('6fc05bed-a86d-684a-eced-5d6abad6bb5f', 'en', 'Saul has slain his thousands, but David his ten thousands'),
('b2e72230-6a50-27dc-0589-0c3afd3a926a', 'de', 'David ist stärker als Simson'),
('b2e72230-6a50-27dc-0589-0c3afd3a926a', 'en', 'David is stronger than Samson'),
('af6dc895-5003-2206-ed31-4e3bf8ee4878', 'de', 'Gott hat den Kleinen erhöht'),
('af6dc895-5003-2206-ed31-4e3bf8ee4878', 'en', 'God has raised up the small one'),
('9b915bae-ef2f-6ebf-b352-81313d9b3711', 'de', 'Der Hirte hat den König gerettet'),
('9b915bae-ef2f-6ebf-b352-81313d9b3711', 'en', 'The shepherd has saved the king'),
('5ae3a779-03da-a5cb-456d-baeda04e0f7e', 'de', 'Alte Lappen und zerrissene Kleider'),
('5ae3a779-03da-a5cb-456d-baeda04e0f7e', 'en', 'Old rags and worn-out clothes'),
('f27af60d-5dcd-09d4-2870-98a490b0dcdf', 'de', 'Ein zusammengerolltes Zelt'),
('f27af60d-5dcd-09d4-2870-98a490b0dcdf', 'en', 'A rolled-up tent'),
('ed9ef744-f93a-944d-e03c-4d25ea6075a5', 'de', 'Handvoll trockenes Stroh'),
('ed9ef744-f93a-944d-e03c-4d25ea6075a5', 'en', 'Handfuls of dry straw'),
('3d6465d8-8fc1-d071-d7b7-06a641ddb8d4', 'de', 'Weiche Schaffelle'),
('3d6465d8-8fc1-d071-d7b7-06a641ddb8d4', 'en', 'Soft sheepskins'),
('3c07f024-dd3b-ee0d-24e0-05320d8869bb', 'de', 'Die zwei Zeugen und die 144000'),
('3c07f024-dd3b-ee0d-24e0-05320d8869bb', 'en', 'The two witnesses and the 144,000'),
('4e1de826-4d48-ff27-4f9e-973c520fc8b2', 'de', 'Die Engel und die Ältesten am Thron'),
('4e1de826-4d48-ff27-4f9e-973c520fc8b2', 'en', 'The angels and the elders at the throne'),
('8a4286f4-e69c-3980-e4ce-90b86f105e56', 'de', 'Die Heiligen unter dem Altar'),
('8a4286f4-e69c-3980-e4ce-90b86f105e56', 'en', 'The saints beneath the altar'),
('befe28e1-a4c9-f105-a2a1-4644cb0227cb', 'de', 'Die Könige, die Kaufleute und die Seefahrer der Erde'),
('befe28e1-a4c9-f105-a2a1-4644cb0227cb', 'en', 'The kings, the merchants and the seafarers of the earth'),
('3a51179a-474f-8baa-ff68-6b99ad5b7ea3', 'de', 'Weil er seinem toten Bruder keinen Samen erwecken wollte'),
('3a51179a-474f-8baa-ff68-6b99ad5b7ea3', 'en', 'Because he refused to raise up offspring for his dead brother'),
('e6b5311e-43a7-b333-98a0-1aca89a8248d', 'de', 'Weil er seinen Vater bestahl'),
('e6b5311e-43a7-b333-98a0-1aca89a8248d', 'en', 'Because he robbed his father'),
('710c13d5-33b0-0d13-8352-4dbd57307bc3', 'de', 'Weil er falsche Götter anbetete'),
('710c13d5-33b0-0d13-8352-4dbd57307bc3', 'en', 'Because he worshiped false gods'),
('309c3817-e387-cc31-0b60-3eb70d924b33', 'de', 'Weil er einen Menschen erschlug'),
('309c3817-e387-cc31-0b60-3eb70d924b33', 'en', 'Because he killed a man'),
('382f9d42-8728-fc4a-2c0b-356546d6d540', 'de', 'Ehe der Mond zerbricht und die Sterne fallen'),
('382f9d42-8728-fc4a-2c0b-356546d6d540', 'en', 'Before the moon breaks and the stars fall'),
('b47dcd79-fb9f-2531-fb80-2162bd1237ce', 'de', 'Ehe die Sonne im Meer versinkt und nicht mehr aufsteigt'),
('b47dcd79-fb9f-2531-fb80-2162bd1237ce', 'en', 'Before the sun sinks in the sea and rises no more'),
('c56c14ec-3369-7fe2-da6d-276015f27642', 'de', 'Ehe das Licht der Sterne kalt und leer wird'),
('c56c14ec-3369-7fe2-da6d-276015f27642', 'en', 'Before the light of the stars turns cold and empty'),
('267d2b13-5933-f921-51f5-bd7935ce5986', 'de', 'Ehe die Sonne, das Licht, der Mond und die Sterne sich verfinstern'),
('267d2b13-5933-f921-51f5-bd7935ce5986', 'en', 'Before the sun, the light, the moon and the stars grow dark')
insert into public.answer_option_translations (option_id, lang, text) values
('54f14e2e-1b12-346a-2dd5-8b74992e3b92', 'de', 'Sie wollte sich nicht den betrunkenen Fürsten zeigen'),
('54f14e2e-1b12-346a-2dd5-8b74992e3b92', 'en', 'She would not display herself to the drunken nobles'),
('810b23cd-6a61-c06e-66ce-f9c956212f12', 'de', 'Sie fürchtete die Feinde des Königs'),
('810b23cd-6a61-c06e-66ce-f9c956212f12', 'en', 'She feared the king''s enemies'),
('ae5403bf-8bb6-736e-0d02-5b56ebaba676', 'de', 'Sie war krank und konnte nicht kommen'),
('ae5403bf-8bb6-736e-0d02-5b56ebaba676', 'en', 'She was ill and could not come'),
('171f9e86-15eb-640c-e8e5-25cf4a5df8e6', 'de', 'Sie hatte ein eigenes Fest für die Frauen'),
('171f9e86-15eb-640c-e8e5-25cf4a5df8e6', 'en', 'She had her own feast for the women'),
('824c3250-abfb-5bd6-517a-115e90735d83', 'de', 'Eine Krone und ein Bogen'),
('824c3250-abfb-5bd6-517a-115e90735d83', 'en', 'A crown and a bow'),
('920d4f31-726c-0458-512a-ef0f7227e952', 'de', 'Eine Waage, um Getreide zuzumessen'),
('920d4f31-726c-0458-512a-ef0f7227e952', 'en', 'A scale to measure out grain'),
('3c87006b-62f3-e8ff-701c-5399a613b6c7', 'de', 'Den Frieden von der Erde zu nehmen, und ein großes Schwert'),
('3c87006b-62f3-e8ff-701c-5399a613b6c7', 'en', 'To take peace from the earth, and a great sword'),
('aa76ac52-1b92-09dc-a9a1-704c87a9cec4', 'de', 'Macht über den vierten Teil der Erde'),
('aa76ac52-1b92-09dc-a9a1-704c87a9cec4', 'en', 'Power over a fourth of the earth'),
('d37bb7b7-5c79-faaf-d283-de0a1a48852f', 'de', 'Weil Ham die Blöße seines Vaters gesehen und es weitererzählt hatte'),
('d37bb7b7-5c79-faaf-d283-de0a1a48852f', 'en', 'Because Ham saw his father''s nakedness and told it'),
('b662a386-fd7c-0530-93bd-d65c1aa236f5', 'de', 'Weil Kanaan das Zelt niedergerissen hatte'),
('b662a386-fd7c-0530-93bd-d65c1aa236f5', 'en', 'Because Canaan had torn down the tent'),
('607f627c-8686-ee15-716b-ea60080fa9b5', 'de', 'Weil Kanaan seinen Brüdern geflucht hatte'),
('607f627c-8686-ee15-716b-ea60080fa9b5', 'en', 'Because Canaan had cursed his brothers'),
('a47c32b1-e064-f970-f918-453d565c052a', 'de', 'Weil Ham den Wein Noahs gestohlen hatte'),
('a47c32b1-e064-f970-f918-453d565c052a', 'en', 'Because Ham had stolen Noah''s wine'),
('c65bd74d-40f8-8a05-5505-d0328e1f625a', 'de', '7 Tage'),
('c65bd74d-40f8-8a05-5505-d0328e1f625a', 'en', '7 days'),
('c71e8f42-0f3e-b4b7-8394-4ef18506a29d', 'de', '100 Tage'),
('c71e8f42-0f3e-b4b7-8394-4ef18506a29d', 'en', '100 days'),
('9623f9fc-802b-df53-a535-9df3aabc93c5', 'de', '40 Tage'),
('9623f9fc-802b-df53-a535-9df3aabc93c5', 'en', '40 days'),
('53a632c5-9b85-cb7c-8e45-0b858e98631c', 'de', '390 Tage'),
('53a632c5-9b85-cb7c-8e45-0b858e98631c', 'en', '390 days'),
('649271be-f1a1-f57a-8f7c-9baaf6a5a883', 'de', 'Sechs Jahre'),
('649271be-f1a1-f57a-8f7c-9baaf6a5a883', 'en', 'Six years'),
('ca2b8967-9cc4-20d9-084e-5066ec6c3867', 'de', 'Sieben Jahre'),
('ca2b8967-9cc4-20d9-084e-5066ec6c3867', 'en', 'Seven years'),
('0366917b-bd14-8a05-1c5d-ff8a6474f8b5', 'de', 'Zehn Jahre'),
('0366917b-bd14-8a05-1c5d-ff8a6474f8b5', 'en', 'Ten years'),
('72faa361-78c2-ecff-b90d-e3dd99e47ba8', 'de', 'Drei Jahre'),
('72faa361-78c2-ecff-b90d-e3dd99e47ba8', 'en', 'Three years'),
('09501d72-052d-02f8-f8e5-608372090314', 'de', 'Er werde den Tod nicht sehen, ehe er den Christus gesehen habe'),
('09501d72-052d-02f8-f8e5-608372090314', 'en', 'He would not see death before seeing the Christ'),
('d3d43300-0216-7f8f-b04c-b5e7d36aff61', 'de', 'Er werde bis ins hohe Alter dem Tempel dienen'),
('d3d43300-0216-7f8f-b04c-b5e7d36aff61', 'en', 'He would serve the temple to old age'),
('521824af-5498-3f6c-4905-e486db095537', 'de', 'Er werde ein Prophet für Israel sein'),
('521824af-5498-3f6c-4905-e486db095537', 'en', 'He would be a prophet for Israel'),
('ae991a18-a258-43de-d76e-a8d3b236d54c', 'de', 'Er werde einen Sohn im Alter empfangen'),
('ae991a18-a258-43de-d76e-a8d3b236d54c', 'en', 'He would father a son in old age'),
('12942cfd-40ef-88c9-d693-babe99b5db8f', 'de', 'Sie pflegte ihn und wärmte ihn, doch er erkannte sie nicht'),
('12942cfd-40ef-88c9-d693-babe99b5db8f', 'en', 'She nursed him and kept him warm, but he did not know her'),
('97c42da6-06ae-20c0-e555-a71ca616bca7', 'de', 'Sie führte für ihn die Regierungsgeschäfte'),
('97c42da6-06ae-20c0-e555-a71ca616bca7', 'en', 'She conducted affairs of state for him'),
('c07a5878-5283-9ad9-e734-6f3e62276410', 'de', 'Sie sang ihm die Psalmen vor'),
('c07a5878-5283-9ad9-e734-6f3e62276410', 'en', 'She sang the psalms to him'),
('ddbff644-458d-4d92-59f0-184195abc54e', 'de', 'Sie deutete ihm die Träume'),
('ddbff644-458d-4d92-59f0-184195abc54e', 'en', 'She interpreted his dreams'),
('8c559e02-df24-0d3e-9bde-b3f3e42ec956', 'de', 'Wie tief reichen die Säulen der Erde?'),
('8c559e02-df24-0d3e-9bde-b3f3e42ec956', 'en', 'How deep reach the pillars of the earth?'),
('8bc4f890-c115-f193-bcb2-9fa0c4f290c9', 'de', 'Wo warst du, als ich die Erde gründete?'),
('8bc4f890-c115-f193-bcb2-9fa0c4f290c9', 'en', 'Where were you when I laid the earth''s foundation?'),
('48154a2e-0318-5b10-5de0-37c13b8812af', 'de', 'Wer hat die Erde aus dem Nichts gerufen?'),
('48154a2e-0318-5b10-5de0-37c13b8812af', 'en', 'Who called the earth out of nothing?'),
('18c8b1a9-b4a5-3f8e-ba75-e5d254315e4f', 'de', 'Wer trägt die Erde auf seinen Schultern?'),
('18c8b1a9-b4a5-3f8e-ba75-e5d254315e4f', 'en', 'Who bears the earth on his shoulders?'),
('a1e52c02-5276-4504-fcea-f8ce8d0286bf', 'de', 'Weißt du, wer die Wolken mit Feuer füllt?'),
('a1e52c02-5276-4504-fcea-f8ce8d0286bf', 'en', 'Do you know who fills the clouds with fire?'),
('abd06b78-decc-6b93-615e-8ebd35334194', 'de', 'Zählst du die Tropfen, die aus den Wolken fallen?'),
('abd06b78-decc-6b93-615e-8ebd35334194', 'en', 'Do you count the drops that fall from the clouds?'),
('b451a663-e680-0c33-4fda-08919a3e497f', 'de', 'Kennst du das Gewicht der Wolken über dem Meer?'),
('b451a663-e680-0c33-4fda-08919a3e497f', 'en', 'Do you know the weight of the clouds over the sea?'),
('647411a2-ec5b-b320-ed71-32263b1d2590', 'de', 'Verstehst du das Ausbreiten der Wolken, die Wunder dessen, der vollkommen an Wissen ist?'),
('647411a2-ec5b-b320-ed71-32263b1d2590', 'en', 'Do you understand the spreading of the clouds, the wonders of him perfect in knowledge?'),
('a36c971e-e0bd-c9b2-38f8-efa0ccd40d2b', 'de', 'Sie sollen ihn nur den Ältesten zeigen'),
('a36c971e-e0bd-c9b2-38f8-efa0ccd40d2b', 'en', 'They should show it only to the elders'),
('5d4e64ac-d33b-1469-233e-fb85e056db23', 'de', 'Sie sollen ihn an Rom weitersenden'),
('5d4e64ac-d33b-1469-233e-fb85e056db23', 'en', 'They should forward it to Rome'),
('5ed587a1-e6dd-37a0-97b4-026795ed8096', 'de', 'Sie sollen ihn auch bei den Laodizäern lesen lassen und den aus Laodizea lesen'),
('5ed587a1-e6dd-37a0-97b4-026795ed8096', 'en', 'They should have it read among the Laodiceans and read the one from Laodicea'),
('36c6f39b-cda8-26dd-b368-437341bf226a', 'de', 'Sie sollen ihn verbrennen nach dem Lesen'),
('36c6f39b-cda8-26dd-b368-437341bf226a', 'en', 'They should burn it after reading'),
('dcbe34bc-50a0-ba3c-7d45-bbe021f4e53a', 'de', 'Nehemia verschüttete den Wein'),
('dcbe34bc-50a0-ba3c-7d45-bbe021f4e53a', 'en', 'Nehemiah spilled the wine'),
('3b87acb7-10a3-9337-7d2a-68ff433b5913', 'de', 'Nehemias Gesicht war traurig, obwohl er nicht krank war'),
('3b87acb7-10a3-9337-7d2a-68ff433b5913', 'en', 'Nehemiah''s face was sad though he was not ill'),
('d0abcfba-8abe-4bff-add4-d3316ed9b7af', 'de', 'Nehemia weinte offen bei Tisch'),
('d0abcfba-8abe-4bff-add4-d3316ed9b7af', 'en', 'Nehemiah wept openly at the table'),
('ac0a92ee-8ec9-f4b8-e0e8-4b8b9f5285b7', 'de', 'Nehemia weigerte sich zu sprechen'),
('ac0a92ee-8ec9-f4b8-e0e8-4b8b9f5285b7', 'en', 'Nehemiah refused to speak'),
('306ab8be-b010-6d4e-f96d-653efb06728b', 'de', 'Paulus reichte ihm ein Kraut von der Insel'),
('306ab8be-b010-6d4e-f96d-653efb06728b', 'en', 'Paul gave him an herb from the island'),
('7ecd7bc7-b649-7a46-f16e-47dc358dc4bc', 'de', 'Paulus betete, legte ihm die Hände auf und heilte ihn von Fieber und Ruhr'),
('7ecd7bc7-b649-7a46-f16e-47dc358dc4bc', 'en', 'Paul prayed, laid hands on him, and healed him of fever and dysentery'),
('6139ab8a-ce97-eead-53d7-b6990109be8c', 'de', 'Paulus taufte ihn sogleich im Meer'),
('6139ab8a-ce97-eead-53d7-b6990109be8c', 'en', 'Paul baptized him at once in the sea'),
('4de00bbb-b521-40a2-eeac-771e0dc8a059', 'de', 'Paulus salbte ihn mit Öl aus dem Schiff'),
('4de00bbb-b521-40a2-eeac-771e0dc8a059', 'en', 'Paul anointed him with oil from the ship'),
('3c92e139-32dd-21a1-aa83-e765db4f5f3b', 'de', 'Zählst du die Schläge seiner mächtigen Hufe?'),
('3c92e139-32dd-21a1-aa83-e765db4f5f3b', 'en', 'Do you count the beats of his mighty hooves?'),
('b596354d-054a-f301-7b41-9cb98999aaf1', 'de', 'Lehrst du das Pferd den Lauf über die Ebene?'),
('b596354d-054a-f301-7b41-9cb98999aaf1', 'en', 'Do you teach the horse to run across the plain?'),
('5de88c27-fcf7-d81a-74f2-d3367d14a87f', 'de', 'Weist du dem Pferd den Weg zur Schlacht?'),
('5de88c27-fcf7-d81a-74f2-d3367d14a87f', 'en', 'Do you show the horse the way to battle?'),
('136c4e56-1d17-8842-caa8-04af57e0580a', 'de', 'Gibst du dem Pferd die Kraft und bekleidest du seinen Hals mit flatternder Mähne?'),
('136c4e56-1d17-8842-caa8-04af57e0580a', 'en', 'Do you give the horse his strength and clothe his neck with a flowing mane?'),
('b2b5e186-bee1-9143-c1d5-977fbabe87b2', 'de', 'Schweigend im Dunkeln'),
('b2b5e186-bee1-9143-c1d5-977fbabe87b2', 'en', 'Silently in the dark'),
('ad287a0d-1607-b325-0a65-c2382656dec7', 'de', 'Lachend und singend'),
('ad287a0d-1607-b325-0a65-c2382656dec7', 'en', 'Laughing and singing'),
('65db3fda-ea07-3a74-1729-9aa4e47e6507', 'de', 'Kniend und betend'),
('65db3fda-ea07-3a74-1729-9aa4e47e6507', 'en', 'Kneeling and praying'),
('0f7148d6-824f-034e-3849-0cec453a2641', 'de', 'Zitternd und mit Beben und Angst'),
('0f7148d6-824f-034e-3849-0cec453a2641', 'en', 'Trembling and with shuddering and anxiety'),
('5d325864-7104-fabf-a83a-c47a7c1bbd79', 'de', 'Willst du nicht ein zweites Weib nehmen?'),
('5d325864-7104-fabf-a83a-c47a7c1bbd79', 'en', 'Will you not take a second wife?'),
('0665888e-7e49-918b-42f5-1a4921cfae47', 'de', 'Hast du beim Priester gefleht?'),
('0665888e-7e49-918b-42f5-1a4921cfae47', 'en', 'Have you pleaded with the priest?'),
('213cef48-2e50-8ce4-1158-90441f6f6c7c', 'de', 'Warum weinst du am Tor des Herrn?'),
('213cef48-2e50-8ce4-1158-90441f6f6c7c', 'en', 'Why do you weep at the door of the Lord?'),
('3fa9bdd0-0e59-31e3-69d6-c9c3a4439beb', 'de', 'Bin ich dir nicht mehr als zehn Söhne?'),
('3fa9bdd0-0e59-31e3-69d6-c9c3a4439beb', 'en', 'Am I not more to you than ten sons?'),
('b9a153cb-29d2-b604-e7c1-56fb6dece178', 'de', 'Er wurde von seinen Dienern verraten'),
('b9a153cb-29d2-b604-e7c1-56fb6dece178', 'en', 'He was betrayed by his servants'),
('f96d9356-7bc0-6d66-0e70-5a5d266515b6', 'de', 'Bogenschützen trafen ihn, obwohl er verkleidet war'),
('f96d9356-7bc0-6d66-0e70-5a5d266515b6', 'en', 'Archers hit him though he was disguised'),
('8bb4e401-64da-25a4-c9a2-e6d2980c9cd1', 'de', 'Er starb an einer Krankheit im Feldlager'),
('8bb4e401-64da-25a4-c9a2-e6d2980c9cd1', 'en', 'He died of illness in the camp'),
('191f7f19-fe25-00f5-86d3-af9f3dd707eb', 'de', 'Er fiel bei einem Sturz vom Wagen'),
('191f7f19-fe25-00f5-86d3-af9f3dd707eb', 'en', 'He fell from his chariot'),
('901b6313-1f7c-6db4-92a5-7e0f332e0f2e', 'de', 'Er starb an einer Krankheit'),
('901b6313-1f7c-6db4-92a5-7e0f332e0f2e', 'en', 'He died of an illness'),
('63a2c22e-e0f6-635c-dcfb-35e63fdf966d', 'de', 'Rechab und Baana erstachen ihn im Schlaf auf seinem Bett'),
('63a2c22e-e0f6-635c-dcfb-35e63fdf966d', 'en', 'Rechab and Baanah stabbed him in his sleep on his bed'),
('cc6b1e91-f4dc-4b89-4ee8-507ac62da7cd', 'de', 'Abner erwürgte ihn im Streit'),
('cc6b1e91-f4dc-4b89-4ee8-507ac62da7cd', 'en', 'Abner strangled him in a quarrel'),
('07781cee-6c5c-a409-9fb7-103f55db6772', 'de', 'Er fiel in einer Schlacht gegen die Philister'),
('07781cee-6c5c-a409-9fb7-103f55db6772', 'en', 'He fell in a battle against the Philistines'),
('d3cdc01e-a127-7ace-4e23-6805f3b5fce2', 'de', 'Abigajil'),
('d3cdc01e-a127-7ace-4e23-6805f3b5fce2', 'en', 'Abigail'),
('ea62bb07-f1af-1491-ac2a-9da5aaeea2c8', 'de', 'Michal'),
('ea62bb07-f1af-1491-ac2a-9da5aaeea2c8', 'en', 'Michal'),
('8642f3f2-b8eb-588d-7527-c66929021092', 'de', 'Zilpa'),
('8642f3f2-b8eb-588d-7527-c66929021092', 'en', 'Zilpah'),
('a81b356a-9582-5896-1bd2-8f62327c38f8', 'de', 'Hadassa'),
('a81b356a-9582-5896-1bd2-8f62327c38f8', 'en', 'Hadassah'),
('9bfd112e-d678-d7bc-6446-c65d33d9f6f0', 'de', 'Silpa'),
('9bfd112e-d678-d7bc-6446-c65d33d9f6f0', 'en', 'Zilpah'),
('0dd869aa-3a98-a59a-d1d5-ce34cb89ed92', 'de', 'Bilha'),
('0dd869aa-3a98-a59a-d1d5-ce34cb89ed92', 'en', 'Bilhah'),
('9a8121cd-9965-c2c4-573a-2df068050de1', 'de', 'Naama'),
('9a8121cd-9965-c2c4-573a-2df068050de1', 'en', 'Naamah'),
('12f85ce0-dd38-283d-f0df-2d6222c01afb', 'de', 'Debora'),
('12f85ce0-dd38-283d-f0df-2d6222c01afb', 'en', 'Deborah'),
('6cab48bf-28ef-fb9d-b542-662f0a785d3c', 'de', 'Aus Rama in Benjamin'),
('6cab48bf-28ef-fb9d-b542-662f0a785d3c', 'en', 'From Ramah in Benjamin'),
('aecb7f1d-2759-3457-d8a5-217fc44dad82', 'de', 'Aus Nazareth in Galiläa'),
('aecb7f1d-2759-3457-d8a5-217fc44dad82', 'en', 'From Nazareth in Galilee'),
('d06c9ab2-16f1-eb8c-695a-dedff3ef76ca', 'de', 'Aus Bethlehem Efrata'),
('d06c9ab2-16f1-eb8c-695a-dedff3ef76ca', 'en', 'From Bethlehem Ephrathah'),
('56d3073b-bb53-d78a-8dc0-60d7819040c4', 'de', 'Aus Silo bei Ephraim'),
('56d3073b-bb53-d78a-8dc0-60d7819040c4', 'en', 'From Shiloh in Ephraim'),
('0f1db2ea-3faa-ec85-04ee-f9ec113d8a91', 'de', 'Wasser aus dem bronzenen Becken'),
('0f1db2ea-3faa-ec85-04ee-f9ec113d8a91', 'en', 'Water from the bronze basin'),
('cad84fcc-6d9b-749e-8c6d-1ee0e913cd9b', 'de', 'Bitteres Wasser mit dem Staub der Wohnung'),
('cad84fcc-6d9b-749e-8c6d-1ee0e913cd9b', 'en', 'Bitter water with the dust of the tabernacle'),
('8b7aca1e-52c6-222e-6ba4-5bbb884d31f6', 'de', 'Oel und Feinmehl in einem Becher'),
('8b7aca1e-52c6-222e-6ba4-5bbb884d31f6', 'en', 'Oil and fine flour in a cup'),
('39893911-338a-c1cb-a0cf-ad95a079c3ef', 'de', 'Wein vermischt mit Galle'),
('39893911-338a-c1cb-a0cf-ad95a079c3ef', 'en', 'Wine mixed with gall'),
('96261763-8f0a-daf7-34fe-835cded3a758', 'de', 'Jagst du der Löwin die Beute und stillst du den Hunger der jungen Löwen?'),
('96261763-8f0a-daf7-34fe-835cded3a758', 'en', 'Do you hunt prey for the lioness and satisfy the hunger of the young lions?'),
('74596f7d-dbef-3484-22ce-1a58b894fc94', 'de', 'Lehrst du die Löwin den Sprung auf die Herde?'),
('74596f7d-dbef-3484-22ce-1a58b894fc94', 'en', 'Do you teach the lioness to leap upon the herd?'),
('b1daa5d4-9756-cabf-8a96-da09934ffbd7', 'de', 'Führst du die Löwin zu ihrem Lager im Fels?'),
('b1daa5d4-9756-cabf-8a96-da09934ffbd7', 'en', 'Do you lead the lioness to her den in the rock?'),
('ff091b15-2cac-d9d0-63d0-bf80b06271a8', 'de', 'Zählst du die Jungen der Löwin im Dickicht?'),
('ff091b15-2cac-d9d0-63d0-bf80b06271a8', 'en', 'Do you count the lioness''s cubs in the thicket?'),
('90063185-3625-0d86-8121-6c2252fad3a4', 'de', 'Sie sprach sofort mit menschlicher Stimme'),
('90063185-3625-0d86-8121-6c2252fad3a4', 'en', 'She spoke at once with a human voice'),
('49c07513-5448-4b01-a786-e88ede911f28', 'de', 'Sie stuerzte ab in eine tiefe Schlucht'),
('49c07513-5448-4b01-a786-e88ede911f28', 'en', 'She fell into a deep ravine'),
('882efa7d-0c91-9b69-0bb6-e9c01e6036f9', 'de', 'Sie lief davon in die Wueste zurueck'),
('882efa7d-0c91-9b69-0bb6-e9c01e6036f9', 'en', 'She ran off back into the wilderness'),
('2be7fd1b-88dd-2f02-8c34-f3c9049ea36d', 'de', 'Sie wich aus und drueckte sich, bis sie sich niederlegte'),
('2be7fd1b-88dd-2f02-8c34-f3c9049ea36d', 'en', 'She turned aside and pressed until she lay down'),
('b40b8128-cab3-d6dd-1e7e-9cc0fb697f20', 'de', 'Der Weg eines Reiters über den Sand'),
('b40b8128-cab3-d6dd-1e7e-9cc0fb697f20', 'en', 'The way of a horseman over the sand'),
('6224b1a8-09d1-7c00-b6f6-b2f8a1fb33ae', 'de', 'Der Weg eines Schiffes mitten im Meer'),
('6224b1a8-09d1-7c00-b6f6-b2f8a1fb33ae', 'en', 'The way of a ship in the midst of the sea'),
('edeb5e9d-a8d7-e495-c535-b14ecae1ef95', 'de', 'Der Weg eines Wagens auf staubiger Straße'),
