('287bb1da-87e9-00b0-edf2-d30ab26686a4', 'en', 'Do I lack madmen that you bring this one?'),
('ea0df258-fe26-8e5a-7f4f-621abbc70164', 'de', 'Bringt ihn in Ketten sofort'),
('ea0df258-fe26-8e5a-7f4f-621abbc70164', 'en', 'Bring him at once in chains'),
('804d6386-b353-333b-4014-7fe77b031ff0', 'de', 'Doch sie suchten Frieden, weil ihr Land vom Königreich ernährt wurde'),
('804d6386-b353-333b-4014-7fe77b031ff0', 'en', 'Yet they sought peace, because their land was fed from the king''s country'),
('eadea1d7-4c5c-ab52-89f5-d4a792b37099', 'de', 'Weil sie seine Boten getötet hatten'),
('eadea1d7-4c5c-ab52-89f5-d4a792b37099', 'en', 'Because they had killed his messengers'),
('d91c73cd-493a-bf83-99a7-4f25cf498c11', 'de', 'Weil sie einen anderen König ausgerufen hatten'),
('d91c73cd-493a-bf83-99a7-4f25cf498c11', 'en', 'Because they had proclaimed another king'),
('a7971e71-1cce-4930-f944-608d616d5441', 'de', 'Weil sie den Tribut verweigert hatten'),
('a7971e71-1cce-4930-f944-608d616d5441', 'en', 'Because they had refused the tribute'),
('36b9b56b-3492-7856-9a0d-0e097ff9094e', 'de', 'Zwölf Jahre'),
('36b9b56b-3492-7856-9a0d-0e097ff9094e', 'en', 'Twelve years'),
('2674dfc8-2e7c-b579-a0a4-73688138e2bc', 'de', 'Achtunddreißig Jahre'),
('2674dfc8-2e7c-b579-a0a4-73688138e2bc', 'en', 'Thirty-eight years'),
('c8d9e504-af38-cefc-0279-936b79cc189d', 'de', 'Acht Jahre'),
('c8d9e504-af38-cefc-0279-936b79cc189d', 'en', 'Eight years'),
('2bb5b50f-cedf-e6a0-4c6e-37f25937fa35', 'de', 'Drei Jahre'),
('2bb5b50f-cedf-e6a0-4c6e-37f25937fa35', 'en', 'Three years'),
('f3ff76ad-f83a-be80-37ff-3a836286aebd', 'de', 'Von Melchisedek, dem Priester'),
('f3ff76ad-f83a-be80-37ff-3a836286aebd', 'en', 'From Melchizedek the priest'),
('94b2292a-9b04-5dd9-af69-9ea139999801', 'de', 'Von Abimelech, dem König'),
('94b2292a-9b04-5dd9-af69-9ea139999801', 'en', 'From Abimelech the king'),
('eec14fed-f595-e2f0-b9e7-abaf3883c07d', 'de', 'Von Efron, dem Hetiter'),
('eec14fed-f595-e2f0-b9e7-abaf3883c07d', 'en', 'From Ephron the Hittite'),
('b88853bb-a906-537b-da89-887d915948f1', 'de', 'Von Mamre, dem Amoriter'),
('b88853bb-a906-537b-da89-887d915948f1', 'en', 'From Mamre the Amorite'),
('0ab6c1c1-6a43-abb2-015f-447684467b92', 'de', 'Auf dem Gipfel des Karmel'),
('0ab6c1c1-6a43-abb2-015f-447684467b92', 'en', 'On the summit of Carmel'),
('9249c3eb-1d7d-aa9c-dcab-ee47636d506b', 'de', 'Am Ufer des Kebar'),
('9249c3eb-1d7d-aa9c-dcab-ee47636d506b', 'en', 'By the banks of the Kebar'),
('2fa7604a-4a8e-66f8-5258-9d6c748efbb8', 'de', 'Auf seinem Wachtturm und der Warte'),
('2fa7604a-4a8e-66f8-5258-9d6c748efbb8', 'en', 'On his watchtower and rampart'),
('3846897a-c9b4-e7c3-9a3e-12e84134ae41', 'de', 'Im Vorhof des Tempels'),
('3846897a-c9b4-e7c3-9a3e-12e84134ae41', 'en', 'In the temple courtyard'),
('7f167451-e8ee-96c4-ad3e-9b0a898307af', 'de', 'Ehe der Krug am Brunnen verdurstet'),
('7f167451-e8ee-96c4-ad3e-9b0a898307af', 'en', 'Before the pitcher at the well runs dry'),
('2e1d2a36-d215-326d-e898-fc3b461eb9dd', 'de', 'Ehe die eherne Säule stürzt und der Marmor zerspringt'),
('2e1d2a36-d215-326d-e898-fc3b461eb9dd', 'en', 'Before the bronze pillar falls and the marble shatters'),
('39c806e5-6bc4-7d65-52ae-245b3e115cc2', 'de', 'Ehe die Lampe erlischt und der Docht verglüht'),
('39c806e5-6bc4-7d65-52ae-245b3e115cc2', 'en', 'Before the lamp goes out and the wick burns away'),
('25473654-6e95-6318-9e5c-f4111d774173', 'de', 'Ehe der silberne Strick zerreißt und die goldene Schale zerbricht'),
('25473654-6e95-6318-9e5c-f4111d774173', 'en', 'Before the silver cord snaps and the golden bowl breaks'),
('0e15441a-ded3-5a35-5e26-8d989d7036af', 'de', 'Sie sollte ihm und den Kamelen zu trinken geben'),
('0e15441a-ded3-5a35-5e26-8d989d7036af', 'en', 'She would give him and the camels water to drink'),
('aaf1d1b1-cab8-98e6-21d9-6894f32c0eab', 'de', 'Sie sollte ihm den Weg weisen'),
('aaf1d1b1-cab8-98e6-21d9-6894f32c0eab', 'en', 'She would show him the way'),
('93897343-3ef1-9def-417b-87098f31bfa1', 'de', 'Sie sollte ihm Gold anbieten'),
('93897343-3ef1-9def-417b-87098f31bfa1', 'en', 'She would offer him gold'),
('90b430b3-c610-f07f-0ef0-68ab55eb191c', 'de', 'Sie sollte seinen Namen kennen'),
('90b430b3-c610-f07f-0ef0-68ab55eb191c', 'en', 'She would know his name'),
('a4973b48-9005-7db4-de2e-1edf2696a976', 'de', 'In weiße Wolken gehüllt, mit einem Schwert in der Hand'),
('a4973b48-9005-7db4-de2e-1edf2696a976', 'en', 'Wrapped in white clouds, a sword in his hand'),
('10bc4b6d-a297-a00f-eb42-0e1eb487eba5', 'de', 'Aus Erz gebildet, mit Flügeln wie ein Adler'),
('10bc4b6d-a297-a00f-eb42-0e1eb487eba5', 'en', 'Formed of bronze, with wings like an eagle'),
('b3638722-ee81-448f-e8d0-d992d8ad8ecc', 'de', 'In Purpur gehüllt, mit einer Krone von Sternen'),
('b3638722-ee81-448f-e8d0-d992d8ad8ecc', 'en', 'Wrapped in purple, with a crown of stars'),
('e08927d0-fd36-a46e-81ee-c4d4521431ff', 'de', 'In Leinen gekleidet, mit Gold von Uphas gegürtet, Augen wie Feuerfackeln'),
('e08927d0-fd36-a46e-81ee-c4d4521431ff', 'en', 'Dressed in linen, girded with gold of Uphaz, eyes like flaming torches'),
('fca6c6a2-027b-1b2d-a287-fc7192d1bd01', 'de', 'Er verfluchte sie mit ewiger Verdammnis'),
('fca6c6a2-027b-1b2d-a287-fc7192d1bd01', 'en', 'He cursed them with eternal damnation'),
('0962d125-ea7d-f1a1-f15b-0f9a6b5544a4', 'de', 'Er ließ sie durch die Ältesten ausschließen'),
('0962d125-ea7d-f1a1-f15b-0f9a6b5544a4', 'en', 'He had them expelled by the elders'),
('cd6a80d6-4bcc-519a-9d93-c952c1a519ad', 'de', 'Er entzog ihnen jede Gemeinschaft für ein Jahr'),
('cd6a80d6-4bcc-519a-9d93-c952c1a519ad', 'en', 'He withdrew all fellowship for one year'),
('fdfec62b-6994-bf48-5d19-aa65c122b080', 'de', 'Er übergab sie dem Satan, damit sie gezüchtigt würden, nicht zu lästern'),
('fdfec62b-6994-bf48-5d19-aa65c122b080', 'en', 'He handed them over to Satan, to be taught not to blaspheme'),
('c8e5f09c-5260-1176-eb00-af555d9510c6', 'de', 'Das mit Feuer vom Altar gefüllte Räuchergefäß'),
('c8e5f09c-5260-1176-eb00-af555d9510c6', 'en', 'The censer filled with fire from the altar'),
('3ba3d995-bf2a-26ed-22b7-664d6aa82585', 'de', 'Eine Handvoll Asche gen Himmel'),
('3ba3d995-bf2a-26ed-22b7-664d6aa82585', 'en', 'A handful of ashes toward heaven'),
('ac7a31d5-8b05-d50a-c32a-fe86ac46981b', 'de', 'Die goldene Schale voll Weihrauch'),
('ac7a31d5-8b05-d50a-c32a-fe86ac46981b', 'en', 'The golden bowl full of incense'),
('f31cc67c-6b76-3824-b791-cb3e351c486f', 'de', 'Das kleine aufgeschlagene Büchlein'),
('f31cc67c-6b76-3824-b791-cb3e351c486f', 'en', 'The little opened scroll'),
('76541e4f-6314-97a2-9e3b-74230fc4edd3', 'de', 'Sie steinigten ihn vor den Toren der Stadt'),
('76541e4f-6314-97a2-9e3b-74230fc4edd3', 'en', 'They stoned him outside the city gates'),
('7dcbeb9d-fb44-37a9-263d-7c7d8d8215a7', 'de', 'Die einen spotteten, andere sagten, sie wollten ihn ein andermal darüber hören'),
('7dcbeb9d-fb44-37a9-263d-7c7d8d8215a7', 'en', 'Some mocked, while others said they would hear him again about this'),
('e453ca65-d0d6-ac47-d12b-b0291a606e7f', 'de', 'Sie verlangten, dass er vor Gericht gestellt werde'),
('e453ca65-d0d6-ac47-d12b-b0291a606e7f', 'en', 'They demanded that he be put on trial'),
('b13a75b8-a581-05e5-4e89-fc039f7d650b', 'de', 'Sie fielen einmütig nieder und beteten an'),
('b13a75b8-a581-05e5-4e89-fc039f7d650b', 'en', 'They fell down together and worshiped'),
('49efd251-e9b3-21fc-55f2-3cda2e6f7d1c', 'de', 'Gib mir weder Armut noch Reichtum'),
('49efd251-e9b3-21fc-55f2-3cda2e6f7d1c', 'en', 'Give me neither poverty nor riches'),
('489adcb0-557c-2fab-8f06-29c467ceb297', 'de', 'Lass mich in Armut demütig bleiben'),
('489adcb0-557c-2fab-8f06-29c467ceb297', 'en', 'Let me stay humble in poverty'),
('34424bb9-6515-f10c-06f2-a1fd5ec32955', 'de', 'Mach mich reicher als alle Könige'),
('34424bb9-6515-f10c-06f2-a1fd5ec32955', 'en', 'Make me richer than all kings'),
('6e083002-37f7-72a4-6405-e9b376b14573', 'de', 'Gib mir Schätze für meine Kinder'),
('6e083002-37f7-72a4-6405-e9b376b14573', 'en', 'Give me treasure for my children'),
('7b751032-63d5-3b93-fd44-3db55d7115a6', 'de', 'Zeigt uns den Weg zum Tempel des Herrn'),
('7b751032-63d5-3b93-fd44-3db55d7115a6', 'en', 'Show us the way to the temple of the Lord'),
('fe6e0683-1c09-557c-2011-e856aa3013b3', 'de', 'Beugt euch nieder vor unseren Göttern'),
('fe6e0683-1c09-557c-2011-e856aa3013b3', 'en', 'Bow down before our gods'),
('c9031bad-a38a-f5aa-2c24-76e84804448e', 'de', 'Singt uns eines der Lieder Zions'),
('c9031bad-a38a-f5aa-2c24-76e84804448e', 'en', 'Sing us one of the songs of Zion'),
('a8a20cc6-5a00-8894-2457-83f12bcb1dcc', 'de', 'Nennt uns die Namen eurer Könige'),
('a8a20cc6-5a00-8894-2457-83f12bcb1dcc', 'en', 'Tell us the names of your kings'),
('b11f9257-a2e6-29f5-0a46-262d23f0d018', 'de', 'Er baute die Höhen wieder auf'),
('b11f9257-a2e6-29f5-0a46-262d23f0d018', 'en', 'He rebuilt the high places'),
('c42cfb43-b31a-7e91-f0d7-a1cf31695c28', 'de', 'Er zog erneut gegen Assyrien'),
('c42cfb43-b31a-7e91-f0d7-a1cf31695c28', 'en', 'He marched again against Assyria'),
('cbf2ca34-caf9-bca1-5cc1-8cc34688d387', 'de', 'Er entfernte die fremden Götter aus dem Tempel'),
('cbf2ca34-caf9-bca1-5cc1-8cc34688d387', 'en', 'He removed the foreign gods from the temple'),
('5889ef30-64db-4464-73de-9a3d0610c06c', 'de', 'Er dankte sofort ab'),
('5889ef30-64db-4464-73de-9a3d0610c06c', 'en', 'He immediately abdicated'),
('b60f13de-83c5-0bc3-f89f-1d352ea8d73f', 'de', 'Auf tausend Mann in den Höhlen'),
('b60f13de-83c5-0bc3-f89f-1d352ea8d73f', 'en', 'To one thousand men in the caves'),
('9052a0ea-9099-9da0-17fc-84d3be092889', 'de', 'Auf dreihundert Mann in der Wüste'),
('9052a0ea-9099-9da0-17fc-84d3be092889', 'en', 'To three hundred men in the wilderness'),
('d3da2f07-5faf-23f3-cf35-ffcb79d7cdcc', 'de', 'Auf sechshundert Mann, die zum Felsen Rimmon flohen'),
('d3da2f07-5faf-23f3-cf35-ffcb79d7cdcc', 'en', 'To six hundred men who fled to the rock of Rimmon'),
('ec7eed70-baa8-9490-1623-90da2e708e71', 'de', 'Auf zwölf Männer der Ältesten'),
('ec7eed70-baa8-9490-1623-90da2e708e71', 'en', 'To twelve men of the elders'),
('c1fe1566-6d68-72ca-bd83-e0159db32903', 'de', 'Doeg, der Edomiter'),
('c1fe1566-6d68-72ca-bd83-e0159db32903', 'en', 'Doeg the Edomite'),
('99f217c1-36b2-30b8-b517-82c6c66aacd5', 'de', 'Abner, der Feldhauptmann'),
('99f217c1-36b2-30b8-b517-82c6c66aacd5', 'en', 'Abner the captain'),
('8b0209bf-8dff-3bed-fe0e-dc8caaec0182', 'de', 'Jonatan, sein Sohn'),
('8b0209bf-8dff-3bed-fe0e-dc8caaec0182', 'en', 'Jonathan his son'),
('712b6867-8115-d738-a68b-45de1685b1a0', 'de', 'Der Wächter am Tor'),
('712b6867-8115-d738-a68b-45de1685b1a0', 'en', 'The watchman at the gate'),
('73898b4d-31ac-93b0-3371-cf14faff4410', 'de', 'Er hatte die Löwen mit Fleisch gefüttert'),
('73898b4d-31ac-93b0-3371-cf14faff4410', 'en', 'He had fed the lions with meat'),
('fedaa40b-984b-b72d-c01a-1c343b3646f4', 'de', 'Gott sandte seinen Engel und verschloss den Löwen die Rachen'),
('fedaa40b-984b-b72d-c01a-1c343b3646f4', 'en', 'God sent his angel and shut the lions'' mouths'),
('5c300b5a-ea36-eff5-b2ab-e2cfdb7011a5', 'de', 'Er hatte sich in einer Nische verborgen'),
('5c300b5a-ea36-eff5-b2ab-e2cfdb7011a5', 'en', 'He had hidden in a niche'),
('b50f2e54-3e9f-c8bb-07c4-a78a264c7aaa', 'de', 'Die Löwen waren zu alt zum Angreifen'),
('b50f2e54-3e9f-c8bb-07c4-a78a264c7aaa', 'en', 'The lions were too old to attack'),
('1acc1392-3dcb-1ed0-65fa-064e92382292', 'de', 'Eine Lehrerin des Glaubens'),
('1acc1392-3dcb-1ed0-65fa-064e92382292', 'en', 'A teacher of the faith'),
('356f0689-b91a-e68a-0961-f2fd4a0a0b70', 'de', 'Eine Trösterin in Trübsal'),
('356f0689-b91a-e68a-0961-f2fd4a0a0b70', 'en', 'A comforter in affliction'),
('da64d603-79ed-6d19-38b6-2ac0df4cad12', 'de', 'Eine Beschützerin (Helferin) vieler und auch von ihm'),
('da64d603-79ed-6d19-38b6-2ac0df4cad12', 'en', 'A patroness (helper) of many, and of himself also'),
('bab271d3-f6d2-881d-531c-b1e011e839d2', 'de', 'Eine Botin des Friedens'),
('bab271d3-f6d2-881d-531c-b1e011e839d2', 'en', 'A messenger of peace'),
('c2872436-5d57-ee92-26f2-092f27d75ef9', 'de', 'Man sollte ihnen ein Erbteil zuweisen'),
('c2872436-5d57-ee92-26f2-092f27d75ef9', 'en', 'They were to be given an inheritance'),
('351521d3-e8e1-af4a-06ef-872a0c4eccf0', 'de', 'Man sollte sie nicht bedruecken noch bedraengen'),
('351521d3-e8e1-af4a-06ef-872a0c4eccf0', 'en', 'They were not to be afflicted or oppressed'),
('74e56cbc-69a7-0b96-2e83-fad102c1c60e', 'de', 'Man sollte ihnen den Zehnten geben'),
('74e56cbc-69a7-0b96-2e83-fad102c1c60e', 'en', 'They were to be given the tithe'),
('1ce2b9e5-931a-7b54-d15e-ac7c4d084cb9', 'de', 'Man sollte sie ins Lager der Leviten bringen'),
('1ce2b9e5-931a-7b54-d15e-ac7c4d084cb9', 'en', 'They were to be brought to the Levite camp'),
('c7f5b0a0-0281-2906-dd5b-2363a2fd8935', 'de', 'Seine einzige Tochter mit Tamburin und Reigen'),
('c7f5b0a0-0281-2906-dd5b-2363a2fd8935', 'en', 'His only daughter with timbrels and dancing'),
('3d3aefff-a4c5-4b17-570e-39a8c5bf8c64', 'de', 'Seine Frau mit einem Festmahl'),
('3d3aefff-a4c5-4b17-570e-39a8c5bf8c64', 'en', 'His wife with a feast'),
('1ab3266e-4930-dfe5-78d7-1d5b6f34c7e0', 'de', 'Sein treuer Diener mit Fackeln'),
('1ab3266e-4930-dfe5-78d7-1d5b6f34c7e0', 'en', 'His faithful servant with torches'),
('bec35b80-8b4d-e645-c8a5-540272165387', 'de', 'Sein ältester Sohn mit einem Kranz'),
('bec35b80-8b4d-e645-c8a5-540272165387', 'en', 'His eldest son with a wreath'),
('cdfb531a-c0b0-7f6a-4278-74752da639e7', 'de', 'Ein Tagebuch seiner Taten'),
('cdfb531a-c0b0-7f6a-4278-74752da639e7', 'en', 'A journal of his deeds'),
('6ebb7118-f137-6c66-4b4d-515e4aa54137', 'de', 'Eine Abschrift dieses Gesetzes'),
('6ebb7118-f137-6c66-4b4d-515e4aa54137', 'en', 'A copy of this law'),
('9de3408d-a88e-c844-08cb-6e5da16765ae', 'de', 'Eine Karte des Landes'),
('9de3408d-a88e-c844-08cb-6e5da16765ae', 'en', 'A map of the land'),
('aa779fab-6134-0ef0-5fdb-20ea49d4f180', 'de', 'Eine Liste seiner Krieger'),
('aa779fab-6134-0ef0-5fdb-20ea49d4f180', 'en', 'A list of his warriors'),
('20acdf6c-867c-d13e-f52f-94d994d126dd', 'de', 'Als der die scharfe zweischneidige Schwert hat'),
('20acdf6c-867c-d13e-f52f-94d994d126dd', 'en', 'As the one who has the sharp two-edged sword'),
('b594f8fd-cf52-ff1a-a37c-a1836bf233d6', 'de', 'Als der Amen, der treue und wahrhaftige Zeuge, der Anfang der Schöpfung Gottes'),
('b594f8fd-cf52-ff1a-a37c-a1836bf233d6', 'en', 'As the Amen, the faithful and true witness, the beginning of God''s creation'),
('ccc15df2-7a26-c758-8ed0-ce66ee48932a', 'de', 'Als der die sieben Geister Gottes und die sieben Sterne hat'),
('ccc15df2-7a26-c758-8ed0-ce66ee48932a', 'en', 'As the one who has the seven Spirits of God and the seven stars'),
('719972a1-3d0e-d11b-f005-d12dbf764b5d', 'de', 'Als der Erste und der Letzte, der tot war und lebendig wurde'),
('719972a1-3d0e-d11b-f005-d12dbf764b5d', 'en', 'As the First and the Last, who was dead and came to life'),
('c141eb99-1be9-1d4d-1355-40cfe636e867', 'de', 'Betet ohne Unterlass'),
('c141eb99-1be9-1d4d-1355-40cfe636e867', 'en', 'Pray without ceasing'),
('a630f924-6949-7a8b-efcf-8b547c0c0de6', 'de', 'Grüßt einander mit dem heiligen Kuss'),
('a630f924-6949-7a8b-efcf-8b547c0c0de6', 'en', 'Greet one another with a holy kiss'),
('6d9eb3ba-f694-8ec3-c664-581cd8d83c12', 'de', 'Gedenkt meiner Fesseln'),
('6d9eb3ba-f694-8ec3-c664-581cd8d83c12', 'en', 'Remember my chains'),
('2e44bcc8-b1ff-ccb2-886b-c5040f51fc1a', 'de', 'Bewahrt die Lehre der Apostel'),
('2e44bcc8-b1ff-ccb2-886b-c5040f51fc1a', 'en', 'Keep the apostles'' teaching'),
('b1d59997-78f4-84f9-2838-2352222c45d0', 'de', 'Einen Zweig vom Ölbaum'),
('b1d59997-78f4-84f9-2838-2352222c45d0', 'en', 'A branch from the olive tree'),
('cadf6511-2094-f7fe-ec9e-bdce01a0181d', 'de', 'Eine Handvoll Manna'),
('cadf6511-2094-f7fe-ec9e-bdce01a0181d', 'en', 'A handful of manna'),
('fe482101-e7c5-dfa0-5205-520ac08e38d3', 'de', 'Ein Stück ungesäuertes Brot'),
('fe482101-e7c5-dfa0-5205-520ac08e38d3', 'en', 'A piece of unleavened bread'),
('ae308450-7913-063f-c87a-45b11fc77c33', 'de', 'Eine Buchrolle voll Klagen und Weherufe'),
('ae308450-7913-063f-c87a-45b11fc77c33', 'en', 'A scroll full of laments and woes'),
('b8ca7f34-82dd-da45-2b36-ec09a0c9b6f4', 'de', 'Michael'),
('b8ca7f34-82dd-da45-2b36-ec09a0c9b6f4', 'en', 'Michael'),
('50e052a6-24d1-97dd-a9c9-7f23b685777d', 'de', 'Der starke Engel mit dem Büchlein'),
('50e052a6-24d1-97dd-a9c9-7f23b685777d', 'en', 'The mighty angel with the scroll'),
('0ff7963d-3c75-a12d-2386-f3ccca472dc4', 'de', 'Gabriel'),
('0ff7963d-3c75-a12d-2386-f3ccca472dc4', 'en', 'Gabriel'),
('ef56ce80-02a5-b414-5008-b83cd1a3584c', 'de', 'Der Engel des Abgrunds'),
('ef56ce80-02a5-b414-5008-b83cd1a3584c', 'en', 'The angel of the Abyss'),
('a14b9b86-0fc2-957e-8b95-2ed7b2157cfe', 'de', 'Sie erstarrte in einer Faust um sein Zepter'),
('a14b9b86-0fc2-957e-8b95-2ed7b2157cfe', 'en', 'It froze in a fist around his scepter'),
('2a7e52db-304c-9113-1fac-703df2eb9915', 'de', 'Sie wurde von einem Blitz verbrannt'),
('2a7e52db-304c-9113-1fac-703df2eb9915', 'en', 'It was burned by a bolt of lightning'),
('eb3bd27c-8e0c-5329-3fe5-080d52b8c526', 'de', 'Sie wurde von einer Schlange gebissen'),
('eb3bd27c-8e0c-5329-3fe5-080d52b8c526', 'en', 'It was bitten by a serpent'),
('62817801-c254-bf6c-3228-d3f3661a9d1d', 'de', 'Sie verdorrte, sodass er sie nicht zurückziehen konnte'),
('62817801-c254-bf6c-3228-d3f3661a9d1d', 'en', 'It withered so that he could not draw it back'),
('aef3fae1-385c-b584-8a50-cb202c12e0dc', 'de', 'Mit einem Brandopfer von tausend Rindern'),
('aef3fae1-385c-b584-8a50-cb202c12e0dc', 'en', 'With a burnt offering of a thousand oxen'),
('388137de-eb10-8042-5b17-94666a155d51', 'de', 'Mit einem Fasten von sieben Tagen'),
('388137de-eb10-8042-5b17-94666a155d51', 'en', 'With a fast of seven days'),
('c609e6be-bb42-5c06-42c9-67914ea39e81', 'de', 'Mit einer Volkszählung aller Bewohner'),
('c609e6be-bb42-5c06-42c9-67914ea39e81', 'en', 'With a census of all inhabitants'),
('ae1ebc87-d212-f501-6b4a-92f85cd3803c', 'de', 'Mit zwei großen Dankchören, die in entgegengesetzte Richtungen auf der Mauer zogen'),
('ae1ebc87-d212-f501-6b4a-92f85cd3803c', 'en', 'With two great thanksgiving choirs walking in opposite directions on the wall'),
('97edd810-7ab5-658c-1521-cba60382b085', 'de', 'Das Allerheiligste hinter dem Vorhang'),
('97edd810-7ab5-658c-1521-cba60382b085', 'en', 'The Most Holy Place behind the veil'),
('f84d6ccc-c6d1-173c-a820-771cf6bfe556', 'de', 'Das Zelt der Zusammenkunft am Morgen'),
('f84d6ccc-c6d1-173c-a820-771cf6bfe556', 'en', 'The tent of meeting in the morning'),
('cc2fecb4-98af-bdf6-2311-d9daf7a92bc7', 'de', 'Den Vorhof mit dem bronzenen Altar'),
('cc2fecb4-98af-bdf6-2311-d9daf7a92bc7', 'en', 'The court with the bronze altar'),
('4d0c6606-53af-dd84-3c01-444f413e4c84', 'de', 'Die Kammer der Leviten'),
('4d0c6606-53af-dd84-3c01-444f413e4c84', 'en', 'The chamber of the Levites'),
('b825a5e8-6445-6920-c7e1-3255f11abbc6', 'de', 'Er drohte, den Tempel der Artemis zu schließen'),
('b825a5e8-6445-6920-c7e1-3255f11abbc6', 'en', 'He threatened to close the temple of Artemis'),
('37125359-c77b-a724-b0be-41070a02db8d', 'de', 'Er versprach, Paulus sofort hinzurichten'),
('37125359-c77b-a724-b0be-41070a02db8d', 'en', 'He promised to execute Paul at once'),
('ce7218d9-3d4b-bfe3-4a5c-b6c8be62bbb7', 'de', 'Er wies auf die ordentlichen Gerichtstage und die Statthalter, vor denen man klagen könne'),
('ce7218d9-3d4b-bfe3-4a5c-b6c8be62bbb7', 'en', 'He pointed to the lawful court days and the proconsuls before whom to bring charges'),
('b5d670f5-2e83-6e89-aaa6-bf72f4e53928', 'de', 'Er ließ Soldaten das Theater umstellen'),
('b5d670f5-2e83-6e89-aaa6-bf72f4e53928', 'en', 'He had soldiers surround the theater'),
('32d9ccfc-f47c-a716-be89-cf25f517df5c', 'de', 'Die Lehre der Nikolaiten allein'),
('32d9ccfc-f47c-a716-be89-cf25f517df5c', 'en', 'The teaching of the Nicolaitans alone'),
('4186504b-e62c-c69c-25d8-57bb5a6ccdf1', 'de', 'Das Halten der Werke der Nikolaiten und der Isebel'),
('4186504b-e62c-c69c-25d8-57bb5a6ccdf1', 'en', 'Holding to the works of the Nicolaitans and Jezebel'),
('48b78171-1590-ce34-1abb-12ca50783627', 'de', 'Die Lehre Bileams, Götzenopfer zu essen und Unzucht zu treiben'),
('48b78171-1590-ce34-1abb-12ca50783627', 'en', 'The teaching of Balaam, to eat idol food and commit fornication'),
('6796c598-8e5e-95e7-b2a2-28024cd2c73e', 'de', 'Die Lehre der Isebel, die sich Prophetin nennt'),
('6796c598-8e5e-95e7-b2a2-28024cd2c73e', 'en', 'The teaching of Jezebel, who calls herself a prophetess')
insert into public.answer_option_translations (option_id, lang, text) values
('84e6eb14-b43f-59f1-55e2-923a31158bac', 'de', 'Sie werden in den Feuersee geworfen, den zweiten Tod'),
('84e6eb14-b43f-59f1-55e2-923a31158bac', 'en', 'They are thrown into the lake of fire, the second death'),
('c89dddfa-4e1c-19ed-0824-6303646c1781', 'de', 'Sie werden mit dem Zeichen des Tieres versiegelt'),
('c89dddfa-4e1c-19ed-0824-6303646c1781', 'en', 'They are sealed with the mark of the beast'),
('5445ab6e-298a-8405-8b94-df62180bcb0e', 'de', 'Sie werden in den Abgrund für tausend Jahre gebunden'),
('5445ab6e-298a-8405-8b94-df62180bcb0e', 'en', 'They are bound in the Abyss for a thousand years'),
('8530d44e-db37-8090-8146-11f8afe1a695', 'de', 'Sie werden aus dem neuen Jerusalem verbannt'),
('8530d44e-db37-8090-8146-11f8afe1a695', 'en', 'They are banished from the new Jerusalem'),
('a299f3dd-8288-2c01-fcb9-74c8e52e5829', 'de', 'Rahel und Josef'),
('a299f3dd-8288-2c01-fcb9-74c8e52e5829', 'en', 'Rachel and Joseph'),
('146e8155-0d21-21e3-b9c5-4900767e878e', 'de', 'Isaak, Rebekka und Lea'),
('146e8155-0d21-21e3-b9c5-4900767e878e', 'en', 'Isaac, Rebekah, and Leah'),
('7ad156b6-d5c3-9ca8-26d2-1e9a26d0d797', 'de', 'Esau und Edom'),
('7ad156b6-d5c3-9ca8-26d2-1e9a26d0d797', 'en', 'Esau and Edom'),
('c84ed752-d9d8-3579-8874-6d351336c2e0', 'de', 'Ismael und Hagar'),
('c84ed752-d9d8-3579-8874-6d351336c2e0', 'en', 'Ishmael and Hagar'),
('a87574cf-0e46-1157-c44a-a49868bc3c9e', 'de', 'Ein Prophet, der sein neues Gewand in zwölf Stücke zerriss'),
('a87574cf-0e46-1157-c44a-a49868bc3c9e', 'en', 'A prophet who tore his new cloak into twelve pieces'),
('6d85c299-bbc8-758d-e382-ea965695bdc4', 'de', 'Ein Statthalter über Efraim'),
('6d85c299-bbc8-758d-e382-ea965695bdc4', 'en', 'A district officer over Ephraim'),
('9545b8ed-0674-0fb8-9ac5-9ecb789e3209', 'de', 'Ein Priester des Höhendienstes'),
('9545b8ed-0674-0fb8-9ac5-9ecb789e3209', 'en', 'A priest of the high-place service'),
('191418cb-499d-3e0a-900f-1e105051e3ee', 'de', 'Ein Feldhauptmann Salomos'),
('191418cb-499d-3e0a-900f-1e105051e3ee', 'en', 'An army captain of Solomon'),
('f83d1f26-13ea-000d-bc59-55a52a860b1a', 'de', 'Sie zog ihm den Schuh aus und spuckte ihm ins Gesicht'),
('f83d1f26-13ea-000d-bc59-55a52a860b1a', 'en', 'She pulled off his sandal and spat in his face'),
('5af8aff3-f81a-ca0b-96fc-15655a8498b4', 'de', 'Sie zerriss sein Gewand vor den Ältesten'),
('5af8aff3-f81a-ca0b-96fc-15655a8498b4', 'en', 'She tore his garment before the elders'),
('cd0f7d47-2469-fa56-af92-24be2dfd0431', 'de', 'Sie legte ihm Asche aufs Haupt'),
('cd0f7d47-2469-fa56-af92-24be2dfd0431', 'en', 'She put ashes on his head'),
('a40b3f6b-59f9-85af-72fb-efcd59ed1504', 'de', 'Sie verfluchte ihn am Stadttor'),
('a40b3f6b-59f9-85af-72fb-efcd59ed1504', 'en', 'She cursed him at the city gate'),
('de964fbc-43fa-0139-8d13-e3c8e1506948', 'de', 'Er baute ein neues Tor für die Stadt'),
('de964fbc-43fa-0139-8d13-e3c8e1506948', 'en', 'He built a new gate for the city'),
('5395d52a-5a0a-124a-271d-afcc56229eab', 'de', 'Er wies auf einen Erdbebenschaden hin'),
('5395d52a-5a0a-124a-271d-afcc56229eab', 'en', 'He pointed to earthquake damage'),
('9b147182-66ee-0688-1ad6-66df4ae50974', 'de', 'Er stellte den Auszug der Verbannten dar'),
('9b147182-66ee-0688-1ad6-66df4ae50974', 'en', 'He portrayed the exiles going into captivity'),
('6a323b91-3f41-a5b8-1985-1ce0260795aa', 'de', 'Er zeigte die Flucht des Volkes vor Feuer'),
('6a323b91-3f41-a5b8-1985-1ce0260795aa', 'en', 'He showed the people fleeing fire'),
('e2a3d4ee-209b-f81d-d7ad-a479cb4e4f2f', 'de', 'Seinen Schreiber und Gehilfen'),
('e2a3d4ee-209b-f81d-d7ad-a479cb4e4f2f', 'en', 'His scribe and helper'),
('bf5387d4-c0bc-3f00-cb73-f03a5edf09ea', 'de', 'Seinen Mitgefangenen in Christus Jesus'),
('bf5387d4-c0bc-3f00-cb73-f03a5edf09ea', 'en', 'His fellow prisoner in Christ Jesus'),
('9c8ac231-0f93-8543-c577-5c975ad3a3ff', 'de', 'Seinen Sohn im Glauben'),
('9c8ac231-0f93-8543-c577-5c975ad3a3ff', 'en', 'His son in the faith'),
('45dccce4-10ad-2a1b-91e4-c8b2185c45a8', 'de', 'Seinen Boten aus Kolossä'),
('45dccce4-10ad-2a1b-91e4-c8b2185c45a8', 'en', 'His messenger from Colossae'),
('51fd8b5a-d4fe-7c97-92db-8ec35fb47398', 'de', 'Er hat den Kaiser gelästert'),
('51fd8b5a-d4fe-7c97-92db-8ec35fb47398', 'en', 'He has blasphemed the emperor'),
('3f7995a2-95aa-0ce3-bebc-9d788705a45a', 'de', 'Lasst ihn frei, er ist unschuldig'),
('3f7995a2-95aa-0ce3-bebc-9d788705a45a', 'en', 'Set him free, he is innocent'),
('7161557e-7710-7b13-f86c-80b259eadf37', 'de', 'Paulus, du rasest, die große Gelehrsamkeit macht dich wahnsinnig'),
('7161557e-7710-7b13-f86c-80b259eadf37', 'en', 'Paul, you are out of your mind, your great learning drives you mad'),
('24b80b53-9266-896a-470e-44229630601c', 'de', 'Genug, führt ihn hinweg zum Tode'),
('24b80b53-9266-896a-470e-44229630601c', 'en', 'Enough, take him away to death'),
('23417ce1-1099-3ca8-9515-7b7007bb7c69', 'de', 'Klemens'),
('23417ce1-1099-3ca8-9515-7b7007bb7c69', 'en', 'Clement'),
('1067f030-09fb-2d02-2641-40b53782f2a5', 'de', 'Tychikus'),
('1067f030-09fb-2d02-2641-40b53782f2a5', 'en', 'Tychicus'),
('afbad40b-6f65-1779-5c5a-515c79e89a8a', 'de', 'Sosthenes'),
('afbad40b-6f65-1779-5c5a-515c79e89a8a', 'en', 'Sosthenes'),
('adadf1d1-0b07-e907-49c9-27837df90292', 'de', 'Aristarchus'),
('adadf1d1-0b07-e907-49c9-27837df90292', 'en', 'Aristarchus'),
('4104353c-5552-a7ef-4344-f7646bf0b333', 'de', 'Ich schweige am Tag und klage nur bei Nacht'),
('4104353c-5552-a7ef-4344-f7646bf0b333', 'en', 'I stay silent by day and lament only at night'),
('d83a96f1-0be6-6e13-97ad-e0b4cf03a5c4', 'de', 'Ich rufe zu den Bergen, doch sie hören mich nicht'),
('d83a96f1-0be6-6e13-97ad-e0b4cf03a5c4', 'en', 'I cry to the mountains, but they do not hear me'),
('335c9b4e-ea4c-bea0-194e-6b3e0b93a3ea', 'de', 'Ich rufe am Tag, und du kommst mir sogleich zu Hilfe'),
('335c9b4e-ea4c-bea0-194e-6b3e0b93a3ea', 'en', 'I cry by day, and you come at once to help me'),
('5ba0e754-1341-0811-dd48-bc1e39f497cd', 'de', 'Ich rufe am Tag, doch du antwortest nicht, und in der Nacht finde ich keine Ruhe'),
('5ba0e754-1341-0811-dd48-bc1e39f497cd', 'en', 'I cry by day, but you do not answer, and by night I find no rest'),
('16316143-5c5c-a494-2328-9a90137d3554', 'de', 'Bus'),
('16316143-5c5c-a494-2328-9a90137d3554', 'en', 'Buz'),
('8162824b-b83c-c7da-2213-286a04cd829e', 'de', 'Kemuel'),
('8162824b-b83c-c7da-2213-286a04cd829e', 'en', 'Kemuel'),
('0b4f2afb-0d0f-cfc4-e070-15c41baef1ae', 'de', 'Us'),
('0b4f2afb-0d0f-cfc4-e070-15c41baef1ae', 'en', 'Uz'),
('dff6ea83-35ad-ad1c-82c4-77739ca20c11', 'de', 'Betuel'),
('dff6ea83-35ad-ad1c-82c4-77739ca20c11', 'en', 'Bethuel'),
('aae95aab-02a3-572f-5695-28493e51c0a9', 'de', 'Er war ihr einziger Sohn und sie war Witwe'),
('aae95aab-02a3-572f-5695-28493e51c0a9', 'en', 'He was her only son and she was a widow'),
('e884e47a-246a-b9b5-5437-0df32a81244e', 'de', 'Er war ihr Bräutigam'),
('e884e47a-246a-b9b5-5437-0df32a81244e', 'en', 'He was her bridegroom'),
('42778b7c-7eab-8421-1b19-85e6474d9dd2', 'de', 'Er war ihr Knecht'),
('42778b7c-7eab-8421-1b19-85e6474d9dd2', 'en', 'He was her servant'),
('6734e436-3f5e-af53-395f-004d3ebc227b', 'de', 'Er war ihr Bruder'),
('6734e436-3f5e-af53-395f-004d3ebc227b', 'en', 'He was her brother'),
('082e1f0d-8efd-300c-44bc-7254b5092ea9', 'de', 'Sie errichteten den Altar und brachten Brandopfer dar'),
('082e1f0d-8efd-300c-44bc-7254b5092ea9', 'en', 'They set up the altar and offered burnt offerings'),
('15136abc-288d-cc9c-3185-fb00c3b59044', 'de', 'Sie verteilten das Land unter die Stämme'),
('15136abc-288d-cc9c-3185-fb00c3b59044', 'en', 'They divided the land among the tribes'),
('62908a12-8282-0685-ae4c-76a86d13fde1', 'de', 'Sie riefen einen König aus'),
('62908a12-8282-0685-ae4c-76a86d13fde1', 'en', 'They proclaimed a king'),
('ea430230-0657-3368-f926-c47a406ec55d', 'de', 'Sie bauten die Stadtmauer wieder auf'),
('ea430230-0657-3368-f926-c47a406ec55d', 'en', 'They rebuilt the city wall'),
('f46dee8c-6001-d945-69f2-afb9bc1b8b3e', 'de', 'Dreihundert Mann'),
('f46dee8c-6001-d945-69f2-afb9bc1b8b3e', 'en', 'Three hundred men'),
('00a43517-f8f8-d29e-276d-a4d2a4692202', 'de', 'Sechshundert Mann'),
('00a43517-f8f8-d29e-276d-a4d2a4692202', 'en', 'Six hundred men'),
('599cd87d-9edb-70da-eb7e-09532c47d9c8', 'de', 'Zwölftausend Mann'),
('599cd87d-9edb-70da-eb7e-09532c47d9c8', 'en', 'Twelve thousand men'),
('bdfed148-0a29-fad1-e28a-5b613ad54bfe', 'de', 'Tausend Mann'),
('bdfed148-0a29-fad1-e28a-5b613ad54bfe', 'en', 'One thousand men'),
('15ee0bdf-2b02-4086-04d6-9ad00c193039', 'de', 'Weil er von ihnen zu Unrecht angeklagt worden war'),
('15ee0bdf-2b02-4086-04d6-9ad00c193039', 'en', 'Because he had been unjustly accused by them'),
('34992270-821b-2759-16c2-5cb227e77327', 'de', 'Weil er ihre Spaltungen nicht mehr ertrug'),
('34992270-821b-2759-16c2-5cb227e77327', 'en', 'Because he could no longer bear their divisions'),
('22f0c7b5-404b-d741-8e34-ccf5558f20ee', 'de', 'Weil sie ihm die Unterstützung entzogen hatten'),
('22f0c7b5-404b-d741-8e34-ccf5558f20ee', 'en', 'Because they had withdrawn their support from him'),
('ab7b7299-c060-352c-8c6b-a335237e6ba0', 'de', 'Weil sie gehört hatten, dass er krank geworden war'),
('ab7b7299-c060-352c-8c6b-a335237e6ba0', 'en', 'Because they had heard that he had fallen ill'),
('11080e1a-3f9d-d2af-9b94-4f784da5f64f', 'de', 'Weißt du, wie salzig das Wasser der Meere ist?'),
('11080e1a-3f9d-d2af-9b94-4f784da5f64f', 'en', 'Do you know how salty the waters of the seas are?'),
('96a21589-2dda-e3c7-a424-a8b3faee0d9b', 'de', 'Bist du zu den Quellen des Meeres gekommen und in den Tiefen des Abgrunds gewandelt?'),
('96a21589-2dda-e3c7-a424-a8b3faee0d9b', 'en', 'Have you entered the springs of the sea and walked in the recesses of the deep?'),
('97b8d86f-f67b-f625-b476-1194b16edf73', 'de', 'Kennst du den Weg der Ströme zum Grund der See?'),
('97b8d86f-f67b-f625-b476-1194b16edf73', 'en', 'Do you know the way of the rivers to the sea floor?'),
('8f94eac9-11c0-c363-a11d-0d0dc72d9ef5', 'de', 'Hast du die Fische in der Tiefe des Meeres gezählt?'),
('8f94eac9-11c0-c363-a11d-0d0dc72d9ef5', 'en', 'Have you counted the fish in the depth of the sea?'),
('8c59279f-9ef2-5e62-1ec3-ebe625fda610', 'de', 'Hungersnot, Flucht vor Feinden oder Pest'),
('8c59279f-9ef2-5e62-1ec3-ebe625fda610', 'en', 'Famine, flight before enemies, or plague'),
('25a32fa3-1979-865b-3042-94dc94c1bc99', 'de', 'Krieg, Aussatz oder Verbannung'),
('25a32fa3-1979-865b-3042-94dc94c1bc99', 'en', 'War, leprosy, or exile'),
('efe92af6-4e3d-586a-21da-3b6c7d73103a', 'de', 'Dürre, Heuschrecken oder Feuer'),
('efe92af6-4e3d-586a-21da-3b6c7d73103a', 'en', 'Drought, locusts, or fire'),
('0e3e4508-ba75-2ef2-0007-2fc2448c4658', 'de', 'Erdbeben, Sturm oder Finsternis'),
('0e3e4508-ba75-2ef2-0007-2fc2448c4658', 'en', 'Earthquake, storm, or darkness'),
('7dc51aad-2e40-24fc-edd6-fd3c15b2c953', 'de', 'Aus den Psalmen Davids'),
('7dc51aad-2e40-24fc-edd6-fd3c15b2c953', 'en', 'From the Psalms of David'),
('05444bb9-e589-7acf-211d-17721d81d6b4', 'de', 'Aus den Worten des Propheten Jesaja'),
('05444bb9-e589-7acf-211d-17721d81d6b4', 'en', 'From the words of the prophet Isaiah'),
('ca7e5baa-7c57-76d8-f424-7f224990a312', 'de', 'Aus den Schriften des Propheten Jeremia'),
('ca7e5baa-7c57-76d8-f424-7f224990a312', 'en', 'From the writings of the prophet Jeremiah'),
('38ff5b46-661e-bc54-5c68-ebc48c64a287', 'de', 'Aus dem Gesetz des Mose'),
('38ff5b46-661e-bc54-5c68-ebc48c64a287', 'en', 'From the law of Moses'),
('d1aca519-51f6-7607-05f4-554e83aa1af6', 'de', 'Ein Schriftgelehrter aus Jerusalem'),
('d1aca519-51f6-7607-05f4-554e83aa1af6', 'en', 'A scribe from Jerusalem'),
('638b2bec-fac8-aed9-617a-022c3c23f3a5', 'de', 'Ein Purpurhändler aus Thyatira'),
('638b2bec-fac8-aed9-617a-022c3c23f3a5', 'en', 'A purple dealer from Thyatira'),
('9035eda8-f4db-43b6-f367-28a7cf7bbd8f', 'de', 'Ein Jünger aus Zypern, ein alter Jünger der ersten Zeit'),
