('cbba5ab0-5e2d-641b-2006-ae98a8a55c1d', 'en', 'Midian'),
('4c65c5a6-3fa1-dee5-fcf1-49057fe850da', 'de', 'Ein Kamel'),
('4c65c5a6-3fa1-dee5-fcf1-49057fe850da', 'en', 'A camel'),
('203224e8-ccd1-2d1f-7e4c-6b43976147f3', 'de', 'Einen Esel'),
('203224e8-ccd1-2d1f-7e4c-6b43976147f3', 'en', 'A donkey'),
('54d3a72d-dc46-dc9e-bd99-0988b6159fbc', 'de', 'Ein Pferd'),
('54d3a72d-dc46-dc9e-bd99-0988b6159fbc', 'en', 'A horse'),
('7bc6b4a5-5b9b-b151-e84b-976561a392ae', 'de', 'Ein Maultier'),
('7bc6b4a5-5b9b-b151-e84b-976561a392ae', 'en', 'A mule'),
('bb9d4577-3332-6cb4-7a4a-da045705f2f2', 'de', 'Weil Timothys Mutter es verlangte'),
('bb9d4577-3332-6cb4-7a4a-da045705f2f2', 'en', 'Because Timothy''s mother demanded it'),
('2a972ce1-ec56-042e-e608-e844c31d2239', 'de', 'Um der Juden willen in jenen Gegenden, denn alle wussten, dass sein Vater ein Grieche war'),
('2a972ce1-ec56-042e-e608-e844c31d2239', 'en', 'For the sake of the Jews in those regions, since all knew his father was a Greek'),
('5a73c97f-b6c2-077f-4262-a6df70012a5e', 'de', 'Weil das Konzil es ausdrücklich befohlen hatte'),
('5a73c97f-b6c2-077f-4262-a6df70012a5e', 'en', 'Because the council had expressly commanded it'),
('fe7ca875-84fa-9c5b-eec7-404a193f07f5', 'de', 'Weil er sonst nicht in den Tempel durfte'),
('fe7ca875-84fa-9c5b-eec7-404a193f07f5', 'en', 'Because he otherwise could not enter the temple'),
('09080c5c-c30a-b2f2-1dc3-dc17b1d4df5d', 'de', 'Fünfzig kräftige Männer'),
('09080c5c-c30a-b2f2-1dc3-dc17b1d4df5d', 'en', 'Fifty strong men'),
('dff9ac7e-fbfe-9270-b2a4-d339dc640486', 'de', 'Sieben Älteste'),
('dff9ac7e-fbfe-9270-b2a4-d339dc640486', 'en', 'Seven elders'),
('e1a8e83a-7f78-d888-cad9-28007514f213', 'de', 'Hundert Krieger'),
('e1a8e83a-7f78-d888-cad9-28007514f213', 'en', 'A hundred warriors'),
('3a6a1d38-7587-4882-9fc1-a085766f94a2', 'de', 'Zwölf Prophetenjünger'),
('3a6a1d38-7587-4882-9fc1-a085766f94a2', 'en', 'Twelve sons of the prophets'),
('09096633-fd44-2f6b-b235-15044c6fbc9a', 'de', 'Sie stahl ihr den Anteil vom Opfer'),
('09096633-fd44-2f6b-b235-15044c6fbc9a', 'en', 'She stole her portion of the sacrifice'),
('12cf2f9f-627f-5407-000e-506311b44efe', 'de', 'Sie kränkte sie, weil der HERR ihren Leib verschlossen hatte'),
('12cf2f9f-627f-5407-000e-506311b44efe', 'en', 'She provoked her because the LORD had closed her womb'),
('a3e741af-b1dd-9570-ddd8-051883cc7ea6', 'de', 'Sie verspottete Elkanas Liebe zu ihr'),
('a3e741af-b1dd-9570-ddd8-051883cc7ea6', 'en', 'She mocked Elkanah''s love for her'),
('d53fa102-3936-77db-e953-544009bde023', 'de', 'Sie schloss sie vom Mahl aus'),
('d53fa102-3936-77db-e953-544009bde023', 'en', 'She shut her out from the feast'),
('29da64c6-a0ec-3d7d-2ba1-1c29d297c697', 'de', 'Er sandte Gold in den Tempel'),
('29da64c6-a0ec-3d7d-2ba1-1c29d297c697', 'en', 'He sent gold to the temple'),
('a3999bd0-d0eb-7e57-94d4-d09128061e2d', 'de', 'Er trug den Knecht selbst zu Jesus'),
('a3999bd0-d0eb-7e57-94d4-d09128061e2d', 'en', 'He carried the servant to Jesus himself'),
('a1b5874c-5178-6e04-63b5-25e45cf9dfb5', 'de', 'Er ließ sagen, Jesus solle nur ein Wort sprechen'),
('a1b5874c-5178-6e04-63b5-25e45cf9dfb5', 'en', 'He sent word that Jesus need only speak a word'),
('4c5fad61-4769-f67c-74c2-6079dc874503', 'de', 'Er bat um ein sichtbares Zeichen'),
('4c5fad61-4769-f67c-74c2-6079dc874503', 'en', 'He asked for a visible sign'),
('91cfa1d4-584e-0e7f-e85e-5f62447d1316', 'de', 'Siebzig Provinzen'),
('91cfa1d4-584e-0e7f-e85e-5f62447d1316', 'en', 'Seventy provinces'),
('cc1e3e44-9c93-d88a-557f-74bb08cb48fe', 'de', 'Hundertsiebenundzwanzig Provinzen'),
('cc1e3e44-9c93-d88a-557f-74bb08cb48fe', 'en', 'A hundred and twenty-seven provinces'),
('a0eb3d55-bafe-5143-8283-58570962a197', 'de', 'Zwölf Provinzen'),
('a0eb3d55-bafe-5143-8283-58570962a197', 'en', 'Twelve provinces'),
('a91aaaee-6a20-9b45-a489-6cccb40664b1', 'de', 'Zweihundert Provinzen'),
('a91aaaee-6a20-9b45-a489-6cccb40664b1', 'en', 'Two hundred provinces'),
('8f59b8d2-8761-15b0-f4e2-5e802692534f', 'de', 'Sie sollten einer jungen Kuh in einem Bachtal das Genick brechen'),
('8f59b8d2-8761-15b0-f4e2-5e802692534f', 'en', 'They should break the neck of a heifer in a valley with a stream'),
('1c9cab50-13a1-a6e0-6cba-43e21e470efd', 'de', 'Sie sollten die Kuh dem Herrn weihen'),
('1c9cab50-13a1-a6e0-6cba-43e21e470efd', 'en', 'They should dedicate the heifer to the Lord'),
('64b4fde1-7b8c-556f-6d3f-8b1b1a151a3c', 'de', 'Sie sollten die Kuh dem Priester opfern'),
('64b4fde1-7b8c-556f-6d3f-8b1b1a151a3c', 'en', 'They should sacrifice the heifer to the priest'),
('dcef45b7-1854-1fcf-1787-22522d0655d0', 'de', 'Sie sollten die Kuh dem nächsten Ort schenken'),
('dcef45b7-1854-1fcf-1787-22522d0655d0', 'en', 'They should give the heifer to the nearest town'),
('d49107f3-9236-c7fb-db77-e353756e8fd6', 'de', 'Das Haus des Stephanas'),
('d49107f3-9236-c7fb-db77-e353756e8fd6', 'en', 'The household of Stephanas'),
('4aec872a-b2a2-29fc-baf4-e55ba84c7822', 'de', 'Das Haus des Gaius'),
('4aec872a-b2a2-29fc-baf4-e55ba84c7822', 'en', 'The household of Gaius'),
('4a9e4985-f562-735b-5591-3f07dfb75867', 'de', 'Das Haus des Krispus'),
('4a9e4985-f562-735b-5591-3f07dfb75867', 'en', 'The household of Crispus'),
('af0b9e72-45a3-2a48-be63-09dc012538d2', 'de', 'Das Haus der Chloe'),
('af0b9e72-45a3-2a48-be63-09dc012538d2', 'en', 'The household of Chloe'),
('013d6e74-5c25-3db6-582e-0a4d45564d0a', 'de', 'Der Schatten sprang zwölf Stufen vor'),
('013d6e74-5c25-3db6-582e-0a4d45564d0a', 'en', 'The shadow leapt forward twelve steps'),
('c5d09c52-8218-d91a-e037-99df0bdee91b', 'de', 'Der Schatten ging zehn Stufen zurück'),
('c5d09c52-8218-d91a-e037-99df0bdee91b', 'en', 'The shadow went back ten steps'),
('eefd81ec-0e1e-d6f8-50b5-822a39a71861', 'de', 'Der Schatten verschwand ganz'),
('eefd81ec-0e1e-d6f8-50b5-822a39a71861', 'en', 'The shadow vanished entirely'),
('9669db93-40e6-2fb3-c366-3807e79c1712', 'de', 'Der Schatten stand still bis zum Abend'),
('9669db93-40e6-2fb3-c366-3807e79c1712', 'en', 'The shadow stood still till evening'),
('c1ace41b-7aed-9d51-d3c6-f04a020a0c5f', 'de', 'Ein Engel Satans, der ihn mit Fäusten schlug'),
('c1ace41b-7aed-9d51-d3c6-f04a020a0c5f', 'en', 'A messenger of Satan to buffet him'),
('8cfd8603-3463-ca8b-bc68-a5dc78f34f0f', 'de', 'Ein Zweifel des Herzens, der ihn quälte'),
('8cfd8603-3463-ca8b-bc68-a5dc78f34f0f', 'en', 'A doubt of heart that tormented him'),
('fb08bc5f-4f7a-6045-b395-258f31d02727', 'de', 'Eine Krankheit der Augen, die ihn blendete'),
('fb08bc5f-4f7a-6045-b395-258f31d02727', 'en', 'A disease of the eyes that blinded him'),
('57d9436b-669a-c783-6b5e-afb010ea9425', 'de', 'Ein Zorn der Juden, der ihn verfolgte'),
('57d9436b-669a-c783-6b5e-afb010ea9425', 'en', 'A wrath of the Jews that pursued him'),
('7d100823-4300-6a43-7dda-e2ad955be59c', 'de', 'Zwei sind stärker als eine ganze Stadt'),
('7d100823-4300-6a43-7dda-e2ad955be59c', 'en', 'Two are stronger than a whole city'),
('86b16ee0-61b0-2491-4ac0-68d103d6e290', 'de', 'Zwei teilen die Last und tragen sie leicht'),
('86b16ee0-61b0-2491-4ac0-68d103d6e290', 'en', 'Two share the burden and bear it lightly'),
('b9cd8a6e-f7b8-3429-616e-50eaf58fb3b6', 'de', 'Zwei sind besser als einer, denn fällt der eine, richtet ihn der andere auf'),
('b9cd8a6e-f7b8-3429-616e-50eaf58fb3b6', 'en', 'Two are better than one, for if one falls, the other lifts him up'),
('54d0dc7b-8d55-081e-fcc6-a0b233f7719c', 'de', 'Zwei sehen mehr als tausend Augen'),
('54d0dc7b-8d55-081e-fcc6-a0b233f7719c', 'en', 'Two see more than a thousand eyes'),
('2ce067d6-a7cb-fba5-6c7a-8fb719ae6774', 'de', 'Er stürzte bei der Verfolgung von einem Felsen'),
('2ce067d6-a7cb-fba5-6c7a-8fb719ae6774', 'en', 'He fell from a cliff during the pursuit'),
('e0222ee0-5739-0295-b9c3-cf1de3c8a85a', 'de', 'Abner stieß ihm das hintere Ende des Speers durch den Leib'),
('e0222ee0-5739-0295-b9c3-cf1de3c8a85a', 'en', 'Abner thrust the butt of his spear through his body'),
('e4561e1c-bb16-597b-03a3-1d1192432ebb', 'de', 'Ein Pfeil traf ihn zwischen die Rippen'),
('e4561e1c-bb16-597b-03a3-1d1192432ebb', 'en', 'An arrow struck him between the ribs'),
('4893d773-9cd6-f15d-7bb1-953a28087b6d', 'de', 'Er ertrank bei der Flucht im Jordan'),
('4893d773-9cd6-f15d-7bb1-953a28087b6d', 'en', 'He drowned in the Jordan while fleeing'),
('a63bc7e1-6e2d-71ea-33a1-c1b2145aadf5', 'de', 'Er wird uns dort verraten werden'),
('a63bc7e1-6e2d-71ea-33a1-c1b2145aadf5', 'en', 'He will be betrayed there'),
('ff3d2cec-da9e-c7ee-a3d1-972e64a61c72', 'de', 'Lasst uns mit ihm ziehen, dass wir mit ihm sterben'),
('ff3d2cec-da9e-c7ee-a3d1-972e64a61c72', 'en', 'Let us go too, that we may die with him'),
('fe458540-4535-43ed-65f0-bf078e99f38a', 'de', 'Bleiben wir lieber in Galiläa'),
('fe458540-4535-43ed-65f0-bf078e99f38a', 'en', 'Let us rather stay in Galilee'),
('7f150246-c139-6752-f7b8-68e7ee31547f', 'de', 'Der Weg ist zu gefährlich für uns'),
('7f150246-c139-6752-f7b8-68e7ee31547f', 'en', 'The road is too dangerous for us'),
('8085c1bf-bfc7-fbf8-de81-1f6b5fc38c12', 'de', 'Die Mahlenden schweigen, weil das Korn zu Ende ist'),
('8085c1bf-bfc7-fbf8-de81-1f6b5fc38c12', 'en', 'The grinders fall silent because the grain is spent'),
('0b9625e8-ec90-3e76-9397-d3e6a60bf526', 'de', 'Die Mahlenden singen, während die Fenster erstrahlen'),
('0b9625e8-ec90-3e76-9397-d3e6a60bf526', 'en', 'The grinders sing while the windows shine'),
('f5fc5d21-5a9d-426b-0505-e5b141723e3c', 'de', 'Die Mahlenden ruhen, weil die Ernte vorüber ist'),
('f5fc5d21-5a9d-426b-0505-e5b141723e3c', 'en', 'The grinders rest because the harvest is over'),
('2a61c514-0523-f531-b1bc-c04df97b297b', 'de', 'Die Mahlenden feiern, weil ihrer wenige sind, und es dunkelt an den Fenstern'),
('2a61c514-0523-f531-b1bc-c04df97b297b', 'en', 'The grinders cease because they are few, and those looking through the windows grow dim'),
('d50aea26-49fe-dd12-540c-7cb7252780e2', 'de', 'Adonija und Kileab'),
('d50aea26-49fe-dd12-540c-7cb7252780e2', 'en', 'Adonijah and Chileab'),
('94b76dcf-617a-3485-c243-46e9d2719fcd', 'de', 'Armoni und Mefiboschet'),
('94b76dcf-617a-3485-c243-46e9d2719fcd', 'en', 'Armoni and Mephibosheth'),
('6b935d17-6dd6-ba4f-f1a1-eb6bc4d2c209', 'de', 'Merab und Michal'),
('6b935d17-6dd6-ba4f-f1a1-eb6bc4d2c209', 'en', 'Merab and Michal'),
('4a2da3dd-5e8a-8040-8501-d3d247d36d93', 'de', 'Jonatan und Abinadab'),
('4a2da3dd-5e8a-8040-8501-d3d247d36d93', 'en', 'Jonathan and Abinadab'),
('b99813ca-2494-869c-0650-e935558e2804', 'de', 'Sie ließ Schebas Kopf über die Mauer zu Joab werfen'),
('b99813ca-2494-869c-0650-e935558e2804', 'en', 'She had Sheba''s head thrown over the wall to Joab'),
('de2877b5-ba5b-268b-57f1-bc8ad90f96a0', 'de', 'Sie überredete Scheba, sich David zu ergeben'),
('de2877b5-ba5b-268b-57f1-bc8ad90f96a0', 'en', 'She persuaded Sheba to surrender to David'),
('9e7c13d5-22b4-12b9-d786-98228ba81e27', 'de', 'Sie öffnete Joab heimlich die Tore der Stadt'),
('9e7c13d5-22b4-12b9-d786-98228ba81e27', 'en', 'She secretly opened the city gates to Joab'),
('715c0ada-9035-88c1-4b86-2db54b5d5784', 'de', 'Sie sandte Joab Gold zur Aufhebung der Belagerung'),
('715c0ada-9035-88c1-4b86-2db54b5d5784', 'en', 'She sent Joab gold to lift the siege'),
('0c5e3c57-c05e-87d7-be0b-4531935ae311', 'de', 'Zehn silberne Schalen'),
('0c5e3c57-c05e-87d7-be0b-4531935ae311', 'en', 'Ten silver bowls'),
('ed14bda7-d462-ea71-8df8-bdefb319aaf0', 'de', 'Sieben goldene Kälber'),
('ed14bda7-d462-ea71-8df8-bdefb319aaf0', 'en', 'Seven golden calves'),
('149cabf5-a09e-eb4c-2809-71c8ffef239d', 'de', 'Fünf goldene Beulen und fünf goldene Mäuse'),
('149cabf5-a09e-eb4c-2809-71c8ffef239d', 'en', 'Five golden tumors and five golden mice'),
('7b35b00b-0b17-caa4-edc4-dcb1ea3f90b2', 'de', 'Ein Bild ihres Gottes aus Gold'),
('7b35b00b-0b17-caa4-edc4-dcb1ea3f90b2', 'en', 'An image of their god in gold'),
('3e105bf9-2b97-c1a5-e49b-e07d5b490952', 'de', 'Er müsse aus dem Stamm Juda kommen'),
('3e105bf9-2b97-c1a5-e49b-e07d5b490952', 'en', 'He must come from the tribe of Judah'),
('d1bb67a8-c5a3-4c40-1c7c-3c6800c212f9', 'de', 'Er solle jährlich das Volk zählen'),
('d1bb67a8-c5a3-4c40-1c7c-3c6800c212f9', 'en', 'He should count the people yearly'),
('65b89be2-210a-37da-bcbd-b806b3ac2fdc', 'de', 'Er solle sich nicht viele Pferde, Frauen oder Silber anschaffen'),
('65b89be2-210a-37da-bcbd-b806b3ac2fdc', 'en', 'He must not acquire many horses, wives or silver'),
('85fc9185-4f4c-d52f-002f-93981c9991e8', 'de', 'Er dürfe keine Kriege führen'),
('85fc9185-4f4c-d52f-002f-93981c9991e8', 'en', 'He must wage no wars'),
('21556b8d-4cb3-8ea3-75b9-246d1ad747c1', 'de', 'Dass es keine Engel und Geister gebe'),
('21556b8d-4cb3-8ea3-75b9-246d1ad747c1', 'en', 'That there were no angels or spirits'),
