('eb9ac812-a500-6a1e-e14b-c2466de55800', 'en', 'That Christ had not come in the flesh'),
('f4eb8d19-b86f-d0cd-490e-1238cf510393', 'de', 'Dass das Gesetz noch immer binde'),
